(1653320, 223235, 15711, '<td valign="top">I''m just taking whichever pic pops up at me, so I''m not viewing titles or thumbnails in advance, and I''m sure there will be many with this "common" title, but your take on it is excellent. I love the sparkle in the eye and the half face lighting.  Great use of negative space and shadow. Nicely done.</td>', 'I''m just taking whichever pic pops up at me, so I''m not viewing titles or thumbnails in advance, and I''m sure there will be many with this "common" title, but your take on it is excellent. I love the sparkle in the eye and the half face lighting.  Great use of negative space and shadow. Nicely done.', '2005-08-29 01:21:18.000000', NULL, 1),
