(1653679, 224070, 25921, '<td valign="top">What an eyecatcher.  Nicely composed.  I''ve got a dog, and I know yours is probably just looking at a smelly spot on the rocks, but it looks to us (the viewer) as if he is stretching the bounds of his (or her) limited mind; contemplating the reflected sky.  Wonderful.</td>', 'What an eyecatcher.  Nicely composed.  I''ve got a dog, and I know yours is probably just looking at a smelly spot on the rocks, but it looks to us (the viewer) as if he is stretching the bounds of his (or her) limited mind; contemplating the reflected sky.  Wonderful.', '2005-08-29 02:56:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1653682, 223421, 3669, '<td valign="top">Excellent job on this photo.  The darkness and grain add greatly to the mood.</td>', 'Excellent job on this photo.  The darkness and grain add greatly to the mood.', '2005-08-29 02:58:06.000000', NULL, 1),
