(1654311, 223352, 36001, '<td valign="top">I love this picture. It has great composition and use of depth of field. I may just have to become a member so I can vote!</td>', 'I love this picture. It has great composition and use of depth of field. I may just have to become a member so I can vote!', '2005-08-29 10:50:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1654314, 223727, 41794, '<td valign="top">Good idea, would have liked it a little more if the dog and lambs were a little closer.</td>', 'Good idea, would have liked it a little more if the dog and lambs were a little closer.', '2005-08-29 10:50:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1654319, 221918, 41794, '<td valign="top">I had the same idea at one point, but decided to try something different.  I would have wanted to eat it all!</td>', 'I had the same idea at one point, but decided to try something different.  I would have wanted to eat it all!', '2005-08-29 10:52:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1654324, 224030, 41794, '<td valign="top">Lovely picture!</td>', 'Lovely picture!', '2005-08-29 10:56:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1654325, 223617, 21216, '<td valign="top">The lighting seems a little flat and therefore it just looks like the picture isn''t really popping. I do love the composition and the setup. You should''ve brought the cards out by maybe dodging them, as well as the ring, that could have created a dramatic image. Great idea nontheless.</td>', 'The lighting seems a little flat and therefore it just looks like the picture isn''t really popping. I do love the composition and the setup. You should''ve brought the cards out by maybe dodging them, as well as the ring, that could have created a dramatic image. Great idea nontheless.', '2005-08-29 10:56:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1654332, 223991, 21216, '<td valign="top">Really great dramatic lighting, there''s a fabulous composition as well but I just wish the eyes would be lighter, well whiter actually, that would really bring them out more. BUt I really do like the even grayscale on the skin. This is maybe one of the best entries about the subject dark and light.</td>', 'Really great dramatic lighting, there''s a fabulous composition as well but I just wish the eyes would be lighter, well whiter actually, that would really bring them out more. BUt I really do like the even grayscale on the skin. This is maybe one of the best entries about the subject dark and light.', '2005-08-29 10:59:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1654333, 223325, 18349, '<td valign="top">One of my personal favorites...very appealing in its grit, drama, and reality.  10.  :)</td>', 'One of my personal favorites...very appealing in its grit, drama, and reality.  10.  :)', '2005-08-29 11:00:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1654336, 223525, 18349, '<td valign="top">I really like this image...the high contrast, even the blown highlights, and the shadow across his face...they add to the emotive quaility.  Well captured.  10 :)</td>', 'I really like this image...the high contrast, even the blown highlights, and the shadow across his face...they add to the emotive quaility.  Well captured.  10 :)', '2005-08-29 11:01:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1654338, 224025, 18349, '<td valign="top">Very dramatic indeed.   Great capture; wish there were more lead room on the left side.  :)</td>', 'Very dramatic indeed.   Great capture; wish there were more lead room on the left side.  :)', '2005-08-29 11:02:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1654340, 223849, 21216, '<td valign="top">Oh I LOVE the crop. Sure some are gonna be bothered about the jets being cut off, but that''s what you have to pay if you want to have a tight crop, and here it looks fabulous. The sharpness is right on spot and the lighting as well. It''s not flat nor is it too contrast. I could only describe it as being perfect.</td>', 'Oh I LOVE the crop. Sure some are gonna be bothered about the jets being cut off, but that''s what you have to pay if you want to have a tight crop, and here it looks fabulous. The sharpness is right on spot and the lighting as well. It''s not flat nor is it too contrast. I could only describe it as being perfect.', '2005-08-29 11:03:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1654341, 223953, 18349, '<td valign="top">How fun...great costume and setting.   A bit bright; would like to see more enhancement of the greens and perhaps some gaussian blur to make it a bit more dreamy.  :)</td>', 'How fun...great costume and setting.   A bit bright; would like to see more enhancement of the greens and perhaps some gaussian blur to make it a bit more dreamy.  :)', '2005-08-29 11:03:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1654344, 223267, 18349, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous capture.  This really belongs in a travel guide somewhere.  :)</td>', 'Gorgeous capture.  This really belongs in a travel guide somewhere.  :)', '2005-08-29 11:04:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1654349, 223947, 41794, '<td valign="top">Amazing colors!</td>', 'Amazing colors!', '2005-08-29 11:05:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1654350, 221537, 18349, '<td valign="top">I really like the processing of this image; great muted color and wonderful texture.  It feels a bit unbalanced, with the sun in the middle as well as the road and the tree...I''d almost prefer to crop the sun entirely out to make it a little more balanced.  Nice image nonetheless.  :)</td>', 'I really like the processing of this image; great muted color and wonderful texture.  It feels a bit unbalanced, with the sun in the middle as well as the road and the tree...I''d almost prefer to crop the sun entirely out to make it a little more balanced.  Nice image nonetheless.  :)', '2005-08-29 11:05:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1654352, 223462, 18349, '<td valign="top">Beautiful and creative entry...Perhaps a tiny bit heavy on the contrast, but nice anyway.  :)</td>', 'Beautiful and creative entry...Perhaps a tiny bit heavy on the contrast, but nice anyway.  :)', '2005-08-29 11:06:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1654353, 223696, 41794, '<td valign="top">Beautiful picture. I think the bird distracts a little though.</td>', 'Beautiful picture. I think the bird distracts a little though.', '2005-08-29 11:06:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1654354, 223267, 21216, '<td valign="top">Yes I can pretty much see this ribbon and it very well deserves it as well, I guess no one can deny that =) Not only is the subject nice on itself, the composition, the lighting and the slight softness just makes this picture all complete. The only thing that bothers me slightly is the contrast, but you know I think it''s just me. This picture makes me want to jump from one rock to another and then swim to the castle. Not swim float, that''s what the long exposure makes me feel like doing. Beautiful</td>', 'Yes I can pretty much see this ribbon and it very well deserves it as well, I guess no one can deny that =) Not only is the subject nice on itself, the composition, the lighting and the slight softness just makes this picture all complete. The only thing that bothers me slightly is the contrast, but you know I think it''s just me. This picture makes me want to jump from one rock to another and then swim to the castle. Not swim float, that''s what the long exposure makes me feel like doing. Beautiful', '2005-08-29 11:07:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1654356, 223215, 18349, '<td valign="top">Very nice portrait.  Good lighting (forehead is a tiny bit bright but not remarkably so), excellent focus, nice contrast and tonal range.  :)</td>', 'Very nice portrait.  Good lighting (forehead is a tiny bit bright but not remarkably so), excellent focus, nice contrast and tonal range.  :)', '2005-08-29 11:08:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1654357, 223452, 41794, '<td valign="top">cute, albeit a bit disturbing! LOL!</td>', 'cute, albeit a bit disturbing! LOL!', '2005-08-29 11:08:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1654364, 223276, 21216, '<td valign="top">Now this is a beautiful cemetary shot. I usually hate them but here it really has a different and lot better appeal. Normally cemetary shots are linked to death, to drama, to poser if you wish. But here it''s just about the beauty of it. I really love the lack of contrast that made the foreground blend into the background magnificently, yet the dodging just seems to contredict that by bringing the tombstone forward and accentuating the details. I''m a sucker for the greens here as well, really neutral greens not too bright, just perfect. The only thing that bothers me is the sky, sure it''s dull but that what creates the magnificent lighting, the thing that bothers me is the blue in the sky, what could be done about that is desaturating the blue and cyans in photoshop. But that''s quite a minor detail that still doesn''t change the fact that the image is just beautiful.</td>', 'Now this is a beautiful cemetary shot. I usually hate them but here it really has a different and lot better appeal. Normally cemetary shots are linked to death, to drama, to poser if you wish. But here it''s just about the beauty of it. I really love the lack of contrast that made the foreground blend into the background magnificently, yet the dodging just seems to contredict that by bringing the tombstone forward and accentuating the details. I''m a sucker for the greens here as well, really neutral greens not too bright, just perfect. The only thing that bothers me is the sky, sure it''s dull but that what creates the magnificent lighting, the thing that bothers me is the blue in the sky, what could be done about that is desaturating the blue and cyans in photoshop. But that''s quite a minor detail that still doesn''t change the fact that the image is just beautiful.', '2005-08-29 11:12:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1654365, 223352, 41794, '<td valign="top">Beautiful.</td>', 'Beautiful.', '2005-08-29 11:12:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1654366, 223982, 22517, '<td valign="top">Beautiful contrast and composition. I would''ve cropped the left bottom corner out. It distracts me.</td>', 'Beautiful contrast and composition. I would''ve cropped the left bottom corner out. It distracts me.', '2005-08-29 11:12:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1654374, 223878, 41794, '<td valign="top">Absolutely beautiful!</td>', 'Absolutely beautiful!', '2005-08-29 11:15:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1654376, 223857, 21216, '<td valign="top">Now this really has something to do with the challenge! =) Fun shot as well as great technically. The lines just seem to be leading the eye to the girl and the green tones are great as well. The fact that you used Shadows/Highlights in photoshop (I''m guessing) made a slight halo around the "dumb" and I think that''s a great detail. The only thing that''s bothering me is the fact that the "dumb"''s shadow is falling on the "lazy"''s head, this could have been avoided by positioning "dumb" at the end of "lazy"''s feet. Still a great shot.</td>', 'Now this really has something to do with the challenge! =) Fun shot as well as great technically. The lines just seem to be leading the eye to the girl and the green tones are great as well. The fact that you used Shadows/Highlights in photoshop (I''m guessing) made a slight halo around the "dumb" and I think that''s a great detail. The only thing that''s bothering me is the fact that the "dumb"''s shadow is falling on the "lazy"''s head, this could have been avoided by positioning "dumb" at the end of "lazy"''s feet. Still a great shot.', '2005-08-29 11:16:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1654380, 222121, 21216, '<td valign="top">Great high key image. It''s incredibly appealing and would make a fabulous commercial image. The bright colours and lights really captures the eyes. Wouldn''t want it on a bilboard though ;) Fear all the accidents. My only advice would be to make the DOF larger so the lollipops in the background could be seen as well.</td>', 'Great high key image. It''s incredibly appealing and would make a fabulous commercial image. The bright colours and lights really captures the eyes. Wouldn''t want it on a bilboard though ;) Fear all the accidents. My only advice would be to make the DOF larger so the lollipops in the background could be seen as well.', '2005-08-29 11:19:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1654394, 223689, 40977, '<td valign="top">Beautiful -</td>', 'Beautiful -', '2005-08-29 11:28:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1654395, 223865, 40977, '<td valign="top">The colors...the shapes...and it''s candy -- I love it!!!</td>', 'The colors...the shapes...and it''s candy -- I love it!!!', '2005-08-29 11:30:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1654396, 224019, 40977, '<td valign="top">Good Image and Great Title - The Snail looks like he is holding his head trying to not be dinner. ORIGINAL</td>', 'Good Image and Great Title - The Snail looks like he is holding his head trying to not be dinner. ORIGINAL', '2005-08-29 11:31:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1654397, 223593, 34192, '<td valign="top">Too bad you put text on your entry.  I''m sure someone will request DQ.  At any rate, the flash is apparent and detracts a little (reflection on the bass) but its a pretty cool image none the less.</td>', 'Too bad you put text on your entry.  I''m sure someone will request DQ.  At any rate, the flash is apparent and detracts a little (reflection on the bass) but its a pretty cool image none the less.', '2005-08-29 11:32:05.000000', NULL, 1),
