(1654401, 221622, 22517, '<td valign="top">I love the expression of the bird! It looks really sad.  And just walking around aimlessly like that. My favourite!</td>', 'I love the expression of the bird! It looks really sad.  And just walking around aimlessly like that. My favourite!', '2005-08-29 11:32:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1654402, 223215, 40977, '<td valign="top">I like the image and it''s a good shot and title.  Was it shot in b/w? The color of the pops might have stood out more - still a great capture.  AND WOW what an expression -- 8</td>', 'I like the image and it''s a good shot and title.  Was it shot in b/w? The color of the pops might have stood out more - still a great capture.  AND WOW what an expression -- 8', '2005-08-29 11:33:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1654412, 223951, 34192, '<td valign="top">Diary or dairy?  Irrelevent.  Like the image.  7, may bump later.</td>', 'Diary or dairy?  Irrelevent.  Like the image.  7, may bump later.', '2005-08-29 11:37:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1654419, 224051, 40797, '<td valign="top">This image is priceless it projects such a sweet feeling. You could not have found a more adorable subject. She has such beautiful eyes and the expression on her face is to die for. I love the doll too!! Compositon, focus, clairity, color are all perfect.  I am a regestered voter but this image makes me want to become a member real soon. Wonderful Job!</td>', 'This image is priceless it projects such a sweet feeling. You could not have found a more adorable subject. She has such beautiful eyes and the expression on her face is to die for. I love the doll too!! Compositon, focus, clairity, color are all perfect.  I am a regestered voter but this image makes me want to become a member real soon. Wonderful Job!', '2005-08-29 11:39:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1654426, 223417, 41794, '<td valign="top">Not sure of the D&amp;L in this shot?</td>', 'Not sure of the D&L in this shot?', '2005-08-29 11:45:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1654427, 223329, 41794, '<td valign="top">Amazing!</td>', 'Amazing!', '2005-08-29 11:45:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1654432, 223730, 21216, '<td valign="top">Now now we all know who took this, and we all know this is going to ribbon right? ;) The eyes of course are magnificent, the colours, the delicatness of the skin, the composition, the background, the model the sharpness, the lighting, the contrast, the strands of hair falling onto her face, details, every little thing is perfect and you really really do know how to work you model. I really can''t say anything that hasn''t been said before.</td>', 'Now now we all know who took this, and we all know this is going to ribbon right? ;) The eyes of course are magnificent, the colours, the delicatness of the skin, the composition, the background, the model the sharpness, the lighting, the contrast, the strands of hair falling onto her face, details, every little thing is perfect and you really really do know how to work you model. I really can''t say anything that hasn''t been said before.', '2005-08-29 11:47:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1654437, 222429, 4477, '<td valign="top">Love the contrast!</td>', 'Love the contrast!', '2005-08-29 11:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1654442, 222613, 40977, '<td valign="top">It''s all about the mood - and you captured it here.</td>', 'It''s all about the mood - and you captured it here.', '2005-08-29 11:51:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1654445, 223325, 22872, '<td valign="top">I really like this photo....my first impression when I look at it is that I''m right there....I''m part of the picture...</td>', 'I really like this photo....my first impression when I look at it is that I''m right there....I''m part of the picture...', '2005-08-29 11:53:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1654448, 223462, 21216, '<td valign="top">This seems very similar to me... hmm... ;)Anyway surely a ribbon with those dots and lines. You did certainly a great makeup job, maybe I could wish the paint was perfect but it really doesn''t have to be, the softness of the skin really makes up for it. Great choice of B&amp;W as well, the dark big eyes are magnificently placed into the crop. The only real thing that''s annoying me here is the earings, they''re brighter than the eyes and because they''re also placed on the third of the frame, they really take your eyes. It would have been lot better without them. But hey, it''s still a beautiful photograph nontheless.</td>', 'This seems very similar to me... hmm... ;)Anyway surely a ribbon with those dots and lines. You did certainly a great makeup job, maybe I could wish the paint was perfect but it really doesn''t have to be, the softness of the skin really makes up for it. Great choice of B&W as well, the dark big eyes are magnificently placed into the crop. The only real thing that''s annoying me here is the earings, they''re brighter than the eyes and because they''re also placed on the third of the frame, they really take your eyes. It would have been lot better without them. But hey, it''s still a beautiful photograph nontheless.', '2005-08-29 11:54:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1654449, 223730, 32084, '<td valign="top">I predict that this shot shall be top 3 - if I could vote I would do my part.  Wonderful piece.</td>', 'I predict that this shot shall be top 3 - if I could vote I would do my part.  Wonderful piece.', '2005-08-29 11:54:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1654452, 223727, 19751, '<td valign="top">This will do great!!!</td>', 'This will do great!!!', '2005-08-29 11:55:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1654461, 223992, 21216, '<td valign="top">Fabulous really fun shot of your daughters. I love everything here, the even exposure, the real yet beautiful colours, the position of the camera to get your models from a low placed, and the composition. Great idea for the challenge as well, impossible to deny that.</td>', 'Fabulous really fun shot of your daughters. I love everything here, the even exposure, the real yet beautiful colours, the position of the camera to get your models from a low placed, and the composition. Great idea for the challenge as well, impossible to deny that.', '2005-08-29 11:57:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1654462, 223452, 22872, '<td valign="top">Ya know...this just ain''t right! LOL...It just cracks me up!!  :)</td>', 'Ya know...this just ain''t right! LOL...It just cracks me up!!  :)', '2005-08-29 11:58:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1654464, 223553, 40977, '<td valign="top">Terrifyingly Terrific.</td>', 'Terrifyingly Terrific.', '2005-08-29 11:58:44.000000', NULL, 1),
