(1654712, 223472, 15711, '<td valign="top">HEE HEE I thought of that one myself.  Great capture. I love the shadows of his ears. Great light.  Super contrast without it being harsh.  I really like this alot. Any shot with a pet gets an extra point from me. 9  I woke up this morning, reviewed this shot again and I''m not changing my opinion or my score.  It''s like you said "Ok, Rover.... are you ready for your portrait now?" and he/she struck this position and froze. hee hee  REALLY REALLY like it</td>', 'HEE HEE I thought of that one myself.  Great capture. I love the shadows of his ears. Great light.  Super contrast without it being harsh.  I really like this alot. Any shot with a pet gets an extra point from me. 9  I woke up this morning, reviewed this shot again and I''m not changing my opinion or my score.  It''s like you said "Ok, Rover.... are you ready for your portrait now?" and he/she struck this position and froze. hee hee  REALLY REALLY like it', '2005-08-29 13:35:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1654715, 223329, 24613, '<td valign="top">Nice job!  Very clear shot.</td>', 'Nice job!  Very clear shot.', '2005-08-29 13:36:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1654717, 221537, 41794, '<td valign="top">Very moody!</td>', 'Very moody!', '2005-08-29 13:36:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1654718, 221622, 34192, '<td valign="top">This is so sad.  No, I know its not really, but your toning, composition, POV, DOF all work with the title to give the image the emotion I think you were looking for.  I can actually believe this bird is depressed and lonely.  If only more people would see the relationship of a good title and an image that goes with it!  10.  Very well done.</td>', 'This is so sad.  No, I know its not really, but your toning, composition, POV, DOF all work with the title to give the image the emotion I think you were looking for.  I can actually believe this bird is depressed and lonely.  If only more people would see the relationship of a good title and an image that goes with it!  10.  Very well done.', '2005-08-29 13:36:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1654719, 222123, 15711, '<td valign="top">I love the springy greens with the splashes of pink. The composition guides your eye from one side to the other without being busy. The varying heights is well balanced but not expected.  The butterflies were certainly cooperative for the shot weren''t they?  Very pretty indeed.</td>', 'I love the springy greens with the splashes of pink. The composition guides your eye from one side to the other without being busy. The varying heights is well balanced but not expected.  The butterflies were certainly cooperative for the shot weren''t they?  Very pretty indeed.', '2005-08-29 13:37:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1654720, 223982, 10985, '<td valign="top">Oh this is looking very professional. Excellent sharpness and angle, superb reflections and light!</td>', 'Oh this is looking very professional. Excellent sharpness and angle, superb reflections and light!', '2005-08-29 13:37:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1654721, 222123, 41794, '<td valign="top">Excellent capture of dark and light with the opposing butterflies!</td>', 'Excellent capture of dark and light with the opposing butterflies!', '2005-08-29 13:37:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1654722, 223948, 10985, '<td valign="top">Beautiful light.</td>', 'Beautiful light.', '2005-08-29 13:37:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1654723, 224019, 41794, '<td valign="top">Great title! Gave me a chuckle!</td>', 'Great title! Gave me a chuckle!', '2005-08-29 13:37:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1654726, 223606, 10985, '<td valign="top">I like these gritty and harsh colors. Nice effect.</td>', 'I like these gritty and harsh colors. Nice effect.', '2005-08-29 13:38:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1654727, 224086, 24613, '<td valign="top">Very moving - good job!</td>', 'Very moving - good job!', '2005-08-29 13:38:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1654728, 223332, 41794, '<td valign="top">I was torn on how to vote for this shot due to the title missing the &amp;...I was voting pretty literal to the challenge. But this is such a poignant shot that I felt it deserved a high score regardless of the title.</td>', 'I was torn on how to vote for this shot due to the title missing the &...I was voting pretty literal to the challenge. But this is such a poignant shot that I felt it deserved a high score regardless of the title.', '2005-08-29 13:39:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1654730, 221537, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like the simplicity of this.  It has a lonely sense to it and your use of brown and gray is interesting and helps convey that message.  I think had it had the sole poplar, It would be perfect, but the two silhouettes are not in anyway bothersome.  This could also be titled  Deep and Lonely.  8</td>', 'I like the simplicity of this.  It has a lonely sense to it and your use of brown and gray is interesting and helps convey that message.  I think had it had the sole poplar, It would be perfect, but the two silhouettes are not in anyway bothersome.  This could also be titled  Deep and Lonely.  8', '2005-08-29 13:39:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1654733, 223295, 41794, '<td valign="top">Great macro!</td>', 'Great macro!', '2005-08-29 13:40:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1654734, 223267, 24613, '<td valign="top">Very pretty and colorful.  The water has a mystical feel to it.  Good work here.</td>', 'Very pretty and colorful.  The water has a mystical feel to it.  Good work here.', '2005-08-29 13:40:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1654736, 224023, 15711, '<td valign="top">My only real criticism is that the skyline is crooked.  You could straighten it and it might make for amore visually appealing shot.  But I must say, the sky is outstanding with it''s vibrant red oranges and blues.  I would have left a bit less negative space at the bottom so that that glorious sky has even more POW factor.  Hope you find this helpful.</td>', 'My only real criticism is that the skyline is crooked.  You could straighten it and it might make for amore visually appealing shot.  But I must say, the sky is outstanding with it''s vibrant red oranges and blues.  I would have left a bit less negative space at the bottom so that that glorious sky has even more POW factor.  Hope you find this helpful.', '2005-08-29 13:40:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1654738, 224070, 41794, '<td valign="top">Muted colors work well for this photo.</td>', 'Muted colors work well for this photo.', '2005-08-29 13:41:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1654740, 223462, 41794, '<td valign="top">Very unique!</td>', 'Very unique!', '2005-08-29 13:42:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1654741, 223370, 15711, '<td valign="top">When I first saw this, I gave it an 8 without hesitation. The linear quality and warm tones with the one dash of red is quite apealing to me. The urban sense and the movement is also another aspect that I appreciate.  The steadfast expression of the driver is really well done too. Great title. Think I''m upping this to a 9.  GOOD JOB!!!</td>', 'When I first saw this, I gave it an 8 without hesitation. The linear quality and warm tones with the one dash of red is quite apealing to me. The urban sense and the movement is also another aspect that I appreciate.  The steadfast expression of the driver is really well done too. Great title. Think I''m upping this to a 9.  GOOD JOB!!!', '2005-08-29 13:42:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1654744, 223421, 41794, '<td valign="top">Would like it better with a little more light on the bottle and glass...</td>', 'Would like it better with a little more light on the bottle and glass...', '2005-08-29 13:43:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1654745, 222755, 24613, '<td valign="top">This is a great idea for this challenge (first one I''ve seen).  The photo has some blown-out areas, but it seems intentions and it work well.  The thin border seems to wrap it all up.  Nice work. 8</td>', 'This is a great idea for this challenge (first one I''ve seen).  The photo has some blown-out areas, but it seems intentions and it work well.  The thin border seems to wrap it all up.  Nice work. 8', '2005-08-29 13:44:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1654746, 224025, 15711, '<td valign="top">Great on stage setting. I love the fog and movement. The colors are wonderful together and it really does tell the story of what''s going on. 8</td>', 'Great on stage setting. I love the fog and movement. The colors are wonderful together and it really does tell the story of what''s going on. 8', '2005-08-29 13:44:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1654749, 223421, 42869, '<td valign="top">Too dark.</td>', 'Too dark.', '2005-08-29 13:44:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1654756, 223452, 42869, '<td valign="top">Colors seem a bit washed out, but bonus points for creativity!</td>', 'Colors seem a bit washed out, but bonus points for creativity!', '2005-08-29 13:45:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1654757, 224004, 7291, '<td valign="top">Nice clarity, very sharp.</td>', 'Nice clarity, very sharp.', '2005-08-29 13:45:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1654758, 223727, 7291, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  Good use of dadge/burn to emphasize the subject.</td>', 'Very nice.  Good use of dadge/burn to emphasize the subject.', '2005-08-29 13:46:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1654759, 222752, 15711, '<td valign="top">I wish she were a tad more focused.  Love the wheaton!!! All animal shots get an extra point from me.  I''m reviewing this again and I love the sentiment.  Nothing beats a sense of affection from a canine friend.  Her pleasant demi-smile appears as if she''s enjoying it equally as much. Her skin tones are good and the symmetry is well done. I stand by my original score of 8 - but this time, with an explanation.</td>', 'I wish she were a tad more focused.  Love the wheaton!!! All animal shots get an extra point from me.  I''m reviewing this again and I love the sentiment.  Nothing beats a sense of affection from a canine friend.  Her pleasant demi-smile appears as if she''s enjoying it equally as much. Her skin tones are good and the symmetry is well done. I stand by my original score of 8 - but this time, with an explanation.', '2005-08-29 13:46:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1654760, 223956, 24613, '<td valign="top">This shot has quite a bit of noise, not that it''s a bad photo.  The large building in the background catches my attention.  Good job! 7</td>', 'This shot has quite a bit of noise, not that it''s a bad photo.  The large building in the background catches my attention.  Good job! 7', '2005-08-29 13:46:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1654766, 223711, 10985, '<td valign="top">I certainly hope this was a set-up. It sure looks real though. Black&amp;White would have made this even more intense.</td>', 'I certainly hope this was a set-up. It sure looks real though. Black&White would have made this even more intense.', '2005-08-29 13:47:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1654770, 223713, 15711, '<td valign="top">This is pretty incredible when you think about it. The vastness of the space above us is actually a multitude of lights and colors and wow - you really nailed it. The blurred silhouettes of the trees may be due to dim lighting, but I almost think you could remove that portion, except for maybe just a small bit for perspective and you''d have an almost perfect image.</td>', 'This is pretty incredible when you think about it. The vastness of the space above us is actually a multitude of lights and colors and wow - you really nailed it. The blurred silhouettes of the trees may be due to dim lighting, but I almost think you could remove that portion, except for maybe just a small bit for perspective and you''d have an almost perfect image.', '2005-08-29 13:49:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1654772, 224070, 24613, '<td valign="top">It took me a little while to realise this was a reflection in the water.  If you cropped out the vegitation on the top of the photo, this would be creepy!  I''m amazed at how clear the reflection is.  Great job!</td>', 'It took me a little while to realise this was a reflection in the water.  If you cropped out the vegitation on the top of the photo, this would be creepy!  I''m amazed at how clear the reflection is.  Great job!', '2005-08-29 13:49:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1654773, 222635, 15711, '<td valign="top">Nice macro. His yellow and black against the green is a stand out.</td>', 'Nice macro. His yellow and black against the green is a stand out.', '2005-08-29 13:50:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1654775, 224070, 7291, '<td valign="top">It''s like the dog is looking down into an abyss.  Great capture.</td>', 'It''s like the dog is looking down into an abyss.  Great capture.', '2005-08-29 13:52:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1654776, 223837, 24613, '<td valign="top">I like the shallow DOF.  Nice work!</td>', 'I like the shallow DOF.  Nice work!', '2005-08-29 13:52:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1654777, 223417, 7291, '<td valign="top">I guess I''m missing where the D&amp;L come in.  Good picture none the less.</td>', 'I guess I''m missing where the D&L come in.  Good picture none the less.', '2005-08-29 13:52:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1654779, 223531, 40977, '<td valign="top">Love the colors and the angle.  Good shot.</td>', 'Love the colors and the angle.  Good shot.', '2005-08-29 13:53:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1654780, 223982, 7291, '<td valign="top">Great abstract.  Blue really works well for refelctive surfaces.</td>', 'Great abstract.  Blue really works well for refelctive surfaces.', '2005-08-29 13:53:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1654782, 223951, 24613, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  Love the clouds contrasting with the green grass.  Good job!</td>', 'Very nice.  Love the clouds contrasting with the green grass.  Good job!', '2005-08-29 13:53:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1654783, 223837, 40977, '<td valign="top">Love the simplicity of the shot.  Great Job!!!</td>', 'Love the simplicity of the shot.  Great Job!!!', '2005-08-29 13:54:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1654785, 223749, 7291, '<td valign="top">Great photo.  The title seems to be a bit of a stretch but the photo works regardless.</td>', 'Great photo.  The title seems to be a bit of a stretch but the photo works regardless.', '2005-08-29 13:55:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1654789, 223905, 40977, '<td valign="top">Love the color -- the lollipop bursts with redness.  The club motion is a bit distracting....good shot.</td>', 'Love the color -- the lollipop bursts with redness.  The club motion is a bit distracting....good shot.', '2005-08-29 13:56:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1654790, 223786, 24613, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot.  Gotta love trains!  Nice reflections in the river.  Sepia tones are wonderful.  Great job! 9</td>', 'Very nice shot.  Gotta love trains!  Nice reflections in the river.  Sepia tones are wonderful.  Great job! 9', '2005-08-29 13:57:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1654792, 224070, 33061, '<td valign="top">Wow, that''s a neat picture. For a minute, I thought it was taken on the top of a very large hill.mountain, over looking a valley full of clouds. Nice!</td>', 'Wow, that''s a neat picture. For a minute, I thought it was taken on the top of a very large hill.mountain, over looking a valley full of clouds. Nice!', '2005-08-29 13:57:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1654794, 223161, 7291, '<td valign="top">That''s great.  I like this one very much.</td>', 'That''s great.  I like this one very much.', '2005-08-29 13:57:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1654797, 223992, 10985, '<td valign="top">Fun portrait. I like the "rounded" look of the image. Good lighting and nice bg. Superb expressions.</td>', 'Fun portrait. I like the "rounded" look of the image. Good lighting and nice bg. Superb expressions.', '2005-08-29 13:58:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1654800, 221537, 40977, '<td valign="top">The best Dark and Light yet.... Love the road and the silhouetted <br/>trees</td>', 'The best Dark and Light yet.... Love the road and the silhouetted trees', '2005-08-29 13:58:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1654802, 223948, 24613, '<td valign="top">Very pleasent shot.  The clouds look great!  The lone tree as a subject works great.  Good job.</td>', 'Very pleasent shot.  The clouds look great!  The lone tree as a subject works great.  Good job.', '2005-08-29 13:59:04.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(1654805, 223124, 43020, '<td valign="top">I''m surprised we were the only two!  :)  I battled with the keys in their new spot for a few days - and I thought I was a touch typist!!  *grin*  Great shot btw!</td>', 'I''m surprised we were the only two!  :)  I battled with the keys in their new spot for a few days - and I thought I was a touch typist!!  *grin*  Great shot btw!', '2005-08-29 14:00:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1654806, 223463, 10985, '<td valign="top">This is poetic. I would much prefer the lttle leaf to be away from the center, but the effect of the shallow DoF and the backlight is very good.</td>', 'This is poetic. I would much prefer the lttle leaf to be away from the center, but the effect of the shallow DoF and the backlight is very good.', '2005-08-29 14:00:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1654808, 222225, 10985, '<td valign="top">Beautiful light.</td>', 'Beautiful light.', '2005-08-29 14:01:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1654809, 223161, 24613, '<td valign="top">Nice use of selective desaturation.  This shot has such an "at rest" feel to it.  Good job!</td>', 'Nice use of selective desaturation.  This shot has such an "at rest" feel to it.  Good job!', '2005-08-29 14:01:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1654811, 224072, 7291, '<td valign="top">Good use of perspective to emphasize the lines.</td>', 'Good use of perspective to emphasize the lines.', '2005-08-29 14:03:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1654813, 223474, 24613, '<td valign="top">What a cutie!!  Very nice portrait, love his expression! 8</td>', 'What a cutie!!  Very nice portrait, love his expression! 8', '2005-08-29 14:03:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1654815, 222225, 7485, '<td valign="top">Great light in the background. Wish that were the main element in the photo, like if you had cropped down to just the upper left quarter.</td>', 'Great light in the background. Wish that were the main element in the photo, like if you had cropped down to just the upper left quarter.', '2005-08-29 14:03:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1654816, 222121, 7291, '<td valign="top">I got a cavity just looking at this.......yum!</td>', 'I got a cavity just looking at this.......yum!', '2005-08-29 14:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1654817, 222459, 24613, '<td valign="top">Wonderful colors in that sky.  Great job!</td>', 'Wonderful colors in that sky.  Great job!', '2005-08-29 14:04:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1654821, 223370, 7291, '<td valign="top">Great interpretation of the challenge theme.  Interesting use of slective desat as well.  That is selctive right?</td>', 'Great interpretation of the challenge theme.  Interesting use of slective desat as well.  That is selctive right?', '2005-08-29 14:05:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1654823, 223786, 7291, '<td valign="top">I love the fact that you can see the smoke way off inthe distance.  I''m not convinced that this was taken with the challenge in mind but it''s a great image.</td>', 'I love the fact that you can see the smoke way off inthe distance.  I''m not convinced that this was taken with the challenge in mind but it''s a great image.', '2005-08-29 14:06:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1654826, 224069, 33068, '<td valign="top">Unique indeed.</td>', 'Unique indeed.', '2005-08-29 14:07:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1654829, 223992, 33889, '<td valign="top">and what beautiful daughters they are.  Nice smiles, good photo.</td>', 'and what beautiful daughters they are.  Nice smiles, good photo.', '2005-08-29 14:08:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1654830, 223711, 7485, '<td valign="top">Beautifully done! Full of emotion, and technically solid. Only change I''d make is to crop a little of the left. 9</td>', 'Beautifully done! Full of emotion, and technically solid. Only change I''d make is to crop a little of the left. 9', '2005-08-29 14:08:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1654832, 223868, 7291, '<td valign="top">I gotta say that "dime &amp; lemonade" works great as a title.  I''m not sure why people ilke to put 2 different titles on their images.  Although it shouldn''t take away from the picture itself, it does for me.  I like the subtle colors in this by the way.</td>', 'I gotta say that "dime & lemonade" works great as a title.  I''m not sure why people ilke to put 2 different titles on their images.  Although it shouldn''t take away from the picture itself, it does for me.  I like the subtle colors in this by the way.', '2005-08-29 14:09:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1654836, 223953, 24613, '<td valign="top">This is very creative.  Nice work!</td>', 'This is very creative.  Nice work!', '2005-08-29 14:09:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1654837, 223730, 38508, '<td valign="top">Now This is what i call a great picture!!!! (10)</td>', 'Now This is what i call a great picture!!!! (10)', '2005-08-29 14:09:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1654839, 222906, 7291, '<td valign="top">Wedding ring on the right hand?  Just an observation.  Funny take on the challenge.</td>', 'Wedding ring on the right hand?  Just an observation.  Funny take on the challenge.', '2005-08-29 14:10:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1654840, 223796, 40977, '<td valign="top">Great Shot - Love the colors and the various textures</td>', 'Great Shot - Love the colors and the various textures', '2005-08-29 14:10:19.000000', NULL, 1),
