(1654876, 223786, 7485, '<td valign="top">Tonal range and composition is just wonderful. But there''s something weird going on with the trees in the middle. They look like the result of a postprocessing mistake, like if you scale down without using any interpolation, or maybe low quality sharpening? 7 (would be a 10 without the artifacts)</td>', 'Tonal range and composition is just wonderful. But there''s something weird going on with the trees in the middle. They look like the result of a postprocessing mistake, like if you scale down without using any interpolation, or maybe low quality sharpening? 7 (would be a 10 without the artifacts)', '2005-08-29 14:16:49.000000', NULL, 1),
