(1655163, 224072, 40675, '<td valign="top">I commented last night that a better title to this photo would be "Duh Loser" and I say that to the subject in the photo and not the photographer since this is a place to coment on the photograph.  It even says above where I am commenting "Comment on this photograph"  and not "Coment on this Photographer"  I have gott''n some feedback on my coment and now I am explaining myself.  I used to be the subject of this photo (big time)  and I was a Duh Loser  please do not get offended to my coment unless you are a Duh Loser.    Oh by the great exposure and B&amp;W conversion.</td>', 'I commented last night that a better title to this photo would be "Duh Loser" and I say that to the subject in the photo and not the photographer since this is a place to coment on the photograph.  It even says above where I am commenting "Comment on this photograph"  and not "Coment on this Photographer"  I have gott''n some feedback on my coment and now I am explaining myself.  I used to be the subject of this photo (big time)  and I was a Duh Loser  please do not get offended to my coment unless you are a Duh Loser.    Oh by the great exposure and B&W conversion.', '2005-08-29 16:08:30.000000', NULL, 1),
