(1655208, 223462, 34659, '<td valign="top">I think I recognize the model here (and she always does great work so if I''m not right, please take it as a compliment!).  Very creative and I love the b/w.  The softness and hardness of the image are quite refreshing and the stare is fantastic.  Great crop.  Some of the "dots" seem a bit off (not especially crisp or well painted on), BUT that''s a very small criticism.  9</td>', 'I think I recognize the model here (and she always does great work so if I''m not right, please take it as a compliment!).  Very creative and I love the b/w.  The softness and hardness of the image are quite refreshing and the stare is fantastic.  Great crop.  Some of the "dots" seem a bit off (not especially crisp or well painted on), BUT that''s a very small criticism.  9', '2005-08-29 16:26:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1655211, 223249, 34659, '<td valign="top">Great shot!  This piece reminds me of the style of a DPCer in Romania or Turkey (I can''t remember which) whose portfolio I reviewed recently.  Her work (as is this) was outstanding.  Very nice job - it has so much captured character. 9</td>', 'Great shot!  This piece reminds me of the style of a DPCer in Romania or Turkey (I can''t remember which) whose portfolio I reviewed recently.  Her work (as is this) was outstanding.  Very nice job - it has so much captured character. 9', '2005-08-29 16:28:20.000000', NULL, 1),
