(1655266, 224023, 17507, '<td valign="top">fits the challenge perfectly, and great colors in the sky. it would have been nice to see some more detail in the building. if you''re using PS, try hitting ctrl-alt-~, which selects the highlights, inverting the selection to the shadows, making a new layer from that inverted selection, and changing the blending mode to "screen." adjust from there. doesn''t need to be a whole lot lighter, just enough to see the major architectural elements.</td>', 'fits the challenge perfectly, and great colors in the sky. it would have been nice to see some more detail in the building. if you''re using PS, try hitting ctrl-alt-~, which selects the highlights, inverting the selection to the shadows, making a new layer from that inverted selection, and changing the blending mode to "screen." adjust from there. doesn''t need to be a whole lot lighter, just enough to see the major architectural elements.', '2005-08-29 16:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1655268, 223642, 17507, '<td valign="top">dolce e legato would seem to call for nice soft lighting, no? the high contrast seems to clash with the subject matter.</td>', 'dolce e legato would seem to call for nice soft lighting, no? the high contrast seems to clash with the subject matter.', '2005-08-29 16:44:49.000000', NULL, 1),
