(1656780, 223243, 33889, '<td valign="top">Cool idea.  I think this photo would have more visual impact if you had gone into Photoshop, selected the entire image, selected "Free Transform", then right-clicked and selected "Distort".  Then you could have pulled on moved around the corner handles until you had all the verticals (lamp posts, etc.) aligned absolutely veritcal. Also, you always want the horizon completely horizontal when water is involved.  I probably would have played with the sky a little to make it slightly darker and bluer at the top and gradually reach its natural color/tone near the horizon.  Just a couple of ideas for what its worth.</td>', 'Cool idea.  I think this photo would have more visual impact if you had gone into Photoshop, selected the entire image, selected "Free Transform", then right-clicked and selected "Distort".  Then you could have pulled on moved around the corner handles until you had all the verticals (lamp posts, etc.) aligned absolutely veritcal. Also, you always want the horizon completely horizontal when water is involved.  I probably would have played with the sky a little to make it slightly darker and bluer at the top and gradually reach its natural color/tone near the horizon.  Just a couple of ideas for what its worth.', '2005-08-30 01:07:58.000000', NULL, 1),
