(1656807, 223249, 33889, '<td valign="top">Boy, you had your choice of titles for this one...  Dark Lenses, Deep Lines, Dour Look, I could go on and on.  Excellent photo by the way.  I love the sharpness (but not over-sharpness), the contrast and tones, the composition and especially your subject.  10</td>', 'Boy, you had your choice of titles for this one...  Dark Lenses, Deep Lines, Dour Look, I could go on and on.  Excellent photo by the way.  I love the sharpness (but not over-sharpness), the contrast and tones, the composition and especially your subject.  10', '2005-08-30 01:14:28.000000', NULL, 1),
