(1657896, 223321, 41554, '<td valign="top">Just a bit noisy on the dark areas, otherwise, very nice.</td>', 'Just a bit noisy on the dark areas, otherwise, very nice.', '2005-08-30 13:56:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1657903, 224053, 36616, '<td valign="top">Good take on theme. Nice clear pic, would have been much more difficult with my all black beast. May have cropped a bit tighter to the right hand side or shot more to the left to avoid the central feel.<br/>Nitpick - shouldn''t it be dog and log ;-)</td>', 'Good take on theme. Nice clear pic, would have been much more difficult with my all black beast. May have cropped a bit tighter to the right hand side or shot more to the left to avoid the central feel.Nitpick - shouldn''t it be dog and log ;-)', '2005-08-30 13:58:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1657911, 224039, 41554, '<td valign="top">Strange colours. There seems to be a lot of colour fringing on this one.</td>', 'Strange colours. There seems to be a lot of colour fringing on this one.', '2005-08-30 13:59:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1657915, 224051, 36616, '<td valign="top">She is a real beauty</td>', 'She is a real beauty', '2005-08-30 14:00:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1657917, 221929, 41554, '<td valign="top">Very nice, but I would have tried to crop out the bottle... but very nice anyways.</td>', 'Very nice, but I would have tried to crop out the bottle... but very nice anyways.', '2005-08-30 14:00:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1657922, 224076, 42714, '<td valign="top">You know, I like the concept and contrast in colors.  But I think this would''ve been a lot more effective had the entire image be sharp - the DOF causes the punctures in the dartboard, not to mention the border between black and yellow to lose their power...also gives it a sense of motion when there really isn''t any.  I think a sharper overall image would pack a lot more punch.</td>', 'You know, I like the concept and contrast in colors.  But I think this would''ve been a lot more effective had the entire image be sharp - the DOF causes the punctures in the dartboard, not to mention the border between black and yellow to lose their power...also gives it a sense of motion when there really isn''t any.  I think a sharper overall image would pack a lot more punch.', '2005-08-30 14:01:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1657923, 223452, 6667, '<td valign="top">My lord!  Somebody needs help!  This takes dog dress up to a different realm.  BOL</td>', 'My lord!  Somebody needs help!  This takes dog dress up to a different realm.  BOL', '2005-08-30 14:01:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1657924, 223837, 41554, '<td valign="top">Very very nice, great light, composition, etc.</td>', 'Very very nice, great light, composition, etc.', '2005-08-30 14:01:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1657925, 223553, 36616, '<td valign="top">Great pic, feel the title to be weak for this challenge.</td>', 'Great pic, feel the title to be weak for this challenge.', '2005-08-30 14:01:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1657927, 223992, 42714, '<td valign="top">First of all....great interactivity with the models.  Whatever you said to get them laugh in such a natural manner, worked splendidly.  Backdrop is great.  Though I think the use of flash could''ve been better, I realize how difficult flash photography in the day can be, and I couldn''t do it better myself.</td>', 'First of all....great interactivity with the models.  Whatever you said to get them laugh in such a natural manner, worked splendidly.  Backdrop is great.  Though I think the use of flash could''ve been better, I realize how difficult flash photography in the day can be, and I couldn''t do it better myself.', '2005-08-30 14:03:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1657932, 223932, 6667, '<td valign="top">Knowing how difficult this is to  capture, you get a 7 from me.  Although, the D&amp;L theme here is a stretch.</td>', 'Knowing how difficult this is to  capture, you get a 7 from me.  Although, the D&L theme here is a stretch.', '2005-08-30 14:05:01.000000', NULL, 1),
