(1658662, 223696, 24642, '<td valign="top">First of all, a very good title, most of the titles in the challenge have a hard time relating to the picture but this one fits like a glove.  Great depth of field, interesting textures on the beach and in the rock.  The rock looks very well and is fully capable of holding up the centered composition.  -10</td>', 'First of all, a very good title, most of the titles in the challenge have a hard time relating to the picture but this one fits like a glove.  Great depth of field, interesting textures on the beach and in the rock.  The rock looks very well and is fully capable of holding up the centered composition.  -10', '2005-08-30 17:42:53.000000', NULL, 1),
