(1659191, 222402, 29557, '<td valign="top">really went all out huh?</td>', 'really went all out huh?', '2005-08-30 20:53:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1659193, 223786, 6999, '<td valign="top">Great sense of flow through the frame here, and a good solid exposure. Your sharpening seems overdone on my screen - the leaves have turned into single pixels almost, but i think the voters generally like that so I can''t blame you. It has interest photographically, almost verging on a sense of the model from your depth of field. Nice work.</td>', 'Great sense of flow through the frame here, and a good solid exposure. Your sharpening seems overdone on my screen - the leaves have turned into single pixels almost, but i think the voters generally like that so I can''t blame you. It has interest photographically, almost verging on a sense of the model from your depth of field. Nice work.', '2005-08-30 20:54:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1659203, 223982, 6999, '<td valign="top">Highly proficient: great shaprness, exposure and processing; strong tonality also. The bottom left exception to the rhythm of the rest of the glass adds an element of concealed surprise, which lifts the whole image.</td>', 'Highly proficient: great shaprness, exposure and processing; strong tonality also. The bottom left exception to the rhythm of the rest of the glass adds an element of concealed surprise, which lifts the whole image.', '2005-08-30 20:57:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1659207, 223452, 29557, '<td valign="top">hahaha</td>', 'hahaha', '2005-08-30 20:58:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1659212, 223948, 6999, '<td valign="top">A fine exposure; a real sense of detail, allied to a strong sense of composition. Effective light too.</td>', 'A fine exposure; a real sense of detail, allied to a strong sense of composition. Effective light too.', '2005-08-30 20:59:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1659225, 223267, 6999, '<td valign="top">Is this not where the causeway runs out to the mount? The cver of a recent National Trust magazine has a better, though similar shot, which includes the first steps along the causeway. There''sa certain magic imparted by the wave-mist around the rock, and the vignetting (whether edited of lens-produced). Perhaps a touch simply ''pretty'' for my taste - but then that''s no easy thing to achieve by any means. Good work.</td>', 'Is this not where the causeway runs out to the mount? The cver of a recent National Trust magazine has a better, though similar shot, which includes the first steps along the causeway. There''sa certain magic imparted by the wave-mist around the rock, and the vignetting (whether edited of lens-produced). Perhaps a touch simply ''pretty'' for my taste - but then that''s no easy thing to achieve by any means. Good work.', '2005-08-30 21:02:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1659233, 223955, 6999, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure whether this is terribly sophisticated or just very simplistic. Isn''t ''dumpsters'' a rather american term for a UK scene? (joke). I think this could do with more contrast work - darken those shadows some: after all, you already have a dirty non-pretty scene, why not go the whole bit and give it some real sense of grime?</td>', 'I''m not sure whether this is terribly sophisticated or just very simplistic. Isn''t ''dumpsters'' a rather american term for a UK scene? (joke). I think this could do with more contrast work - darken those shadows some: after all, you already have a dirty non-pretty scene, why not go the whole bit and give it some real sense of grime?', '2005-08-30 21:05:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1659250, 223307, 32378, '<td valign="top">The heavy lines runnig through this are distracting. Also the smoke or cloud to the right.</td>', 'The heavy lines runnig through this are distracting. Also the smoke or cloud to the right.', '2005-08-30 21:13:26.000000', NULL, 1),
