(1659949, 223307, 42714, '<td valign="top">You know, I hate saying this because I think this photo has a lot of potential...there''s just too much stuff going on here - in the way of lines and grids and how those varying lines and grids all have different perspectives and vanishing points...in other words, it lacks focus.  I might suggest next time doing a shot like this actually pulling yourself away so that there''s not so much distraction.</td>', 'You know, I hate saying this because I think this photo has a lot of potential...there''s just too much stuff going on here - in the way of lines and grids and how those varying lines and grids all have different perspectives and vanishing points...in other words, it lacks focus.  I might suggest next time doing a shot like this actually pulling yourself away so that there''s not so much distraction.', '2005-08-31 00:32:25.000000', NULL, 1),
