(1663425, 223866, 20462, '<td valign="top">for some reason, I find myself drawn to the desert and the very life you mention is what makes it astonishing.  The border is a tad too contrasting with the image, but you will not be docked for that.  I think you did a fine job here.</td>', 'for some reason, I find myself drawn to the desert and the very life you mention is what makes it astonishing.  The border is a tad too contrasting with the image, but you will not be docked for that.  I think you did a fine job here.', '2005-08-31 20:25:06.000000', NULL, 1),
