(1663457, 223329, 20462, '<td valign="top">this is lovely and striking.  the upper third is unnessecary though.  The clouds and the strikes are the focal point here.  you still get a fine score from me.</td>', 'this is lovely and striking.  the upper third is unnessecary though.  The clouds and the strikes are the focal point here.  you still get a fine score from me.', '2005-08-31 20:31:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1663461, 223711, 20462, '<td valign="top">sad and frankly not necessary.  a disturbing image doesn''t and usually almost never makes a good one.  for what is it trying to achieve?  to bring awareness to death?  love?  I can think of better and more tasteful ways of depicting it.</td>', 'sad and frankly not necessary.  a disturbing image doesn''t and usually almost never makes a good one.  for what is it trying to achieve?  to bring awareness to death?  love?  I can think of better and more tasteful ways of depicting it.', '2005-08-31 20:33:27.000000', NULL, 1),
