(1663466, 222767, 20462, '<td valign="top">ughh.  and confusing to take in.  but enlightening in an upfront kind of way.</td>', 'ughh.  and confusing to take in.  but enlightening in an upfront kind of way.', '2005-08-31 20:34:56.000000', NULL, 1),
