(1664961, 223991, 37844, '<td valign="top">This image  grabs your attention . I love everything about it except the angle. It distorts an otherwise lovely eye and nose, making them look over large compared to chin. This may work for some folks taste, but I would have liked to see it without the harsh angle.  Everything else is just beautiful. 7</td>', 'This image  grabs your attention . I love everything about it except the angle. It distorts an otherwise lovely eye and nose, making them look over large compared to chin. This may work for some folks taste, but I would have liked to see it without the harsh angle.  Everything else is just beautiful. 7', '2005-09-01 03:40:34.000000', NULL, 1),
