(1665066, 223713, 37844, '<td valign="top">Wow, this seems exciting and scary to me at the same time, just imagine that is right above us and most of us can''t see it that way.  I am not too crazy about the color in the bottom half of the sky, but I don''t think this is anything you could control ( or at least I couldn''t ) so I won''t let that effect my vote.  Wonderful shot to have in your collection.</td>', 'Wow, this seems exciting and scary to me at the same time, just imagine that is right above us and most of us can''t see it that way.  I am not too crazy about the color in the bottom half of the sky, but I don''t think this is anything you could control ( or at least I couldn''t ) so I won''t let that effect my vote.  Wonderful shot to have in your collection.', '2005-09-01 04:40:40.000000', NULL, 1),
