(1665106, 222123, 37844, '<td valign="top">oh, iI get it, one butterfly is dark and the other is light. This is a lovely photo. You may want to try cropping just the light butterfly and flower for another version, it took mu breath away as I was scrolling down before I even saw the second one. This composition may even work well  selling in advertisement, but I wouldn''t submit it to a cheap paying stock site. Maybe to the Almay Stock Agency. I hear they pay better. 10 for sure</td>', 'oh, iI get it, one butterfly is dark and the other is light. This is a lovely photo. You may want to try cropping just the light butterfly and flower for another version, it took mu breath away as I was scrolling down before I even saw the second one. This composition may even work well  selling in advertisement, but I wouldn''t submit it to a cheap paying stock site. Maybe to the Almay Stock Agency. I hear they pay better. 10 for sure', '2005-09-01 04:54:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1665112, 223851, 37844, '<td valign="top">My favorite colors. Everything about this looks right on. Nothing less than 10.</td>', 'My favorite colors. Everything about this looks right on. Nothing less than 10.', '2005-09-01 04:58:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1665119, 223215, 37844, '<td valign="top">Lighting is good, posing is good, creativity is good, would have like to see color version just to see if it made it better, but won''t effect score. 10</td>', 'Lighting is good, posing is good, creativity is good, would have like to see color version just to see if it made it better, but won''t effect score. 10', '2005-09-01 05:04:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1665121, 223548, 37844, '<td valign="top">The hands seem over saturated so they are a bit distracting . At first glance it looked like three hands were playing the drums.  Overall good exposure.</td>', 'The hands seem over saturated so they are a bit distracting . At first glance it looked like three hands were playing the drums.  Overall good exposure.', '2005-09-01 05:10:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1665128, 223763, 37844, '<td valign="top">Darn, I feel that the straws are actually robbing this photo of  it''s quality. instead of  enhancing it they are making it look cheaper somehow.  I think possibly a lemon slice on the edge of the glass and maybe a none too flashy stir stick would have  added  class. The only way these colorful straws would work in this photo for me is if they had something  definite to do with the title, then  I could overlook their distracting presence.  Love the lighting you used and the exposure and composition. Still rates a 6.</td>', 'Darn, I feel that the straws are actually robbing this photo of  it''s quality. instead of  enhancing it they are making it look cheaper somehow.  I think possibly a lemon slice on the edge of the glass and maybe a none too flashy stir stick would have  added  class. The only way these colorful straws would work in this photo for me is if they had something  definite to do with the title, then  I could overlook their distracting presence.  Love the lighting you used and the exposure and composition. Still rates a 6.', '2005-09-01 05:16:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1665129, 223610, 37844, '<td valign="top">Not as creative as some others here but a well done photo, technically on the mark. 7</td>', 'Not as creative as some others here but a well done photo, technically on the mark. 7', '2005-09-01 05:18:23.000000', NULL, 1),
