(1666807, 223249, 40718, '<td valign="top">I really like this picture.  The negative space echoes the lenses well.  The detail of wrinkles is great as well as his frown.  A tiny bit overexposed on his forehead/scalp.  Don''t worry, I didn''t knock you for not having an ''&amp;''.  8.</td>', 'I really like this picture.  The negative space echoes the lenses well.  The detail of wrinkles is great as well as his frown.  A tiny bit overexposed on his forehead/scalp.  Don''t worry, I didn''t knock you for not having an ''&''.  8.', '2005-09-01 18:17:40.000000', NULL, 1),
