(1666868, 221929, 40718, '<td valign="top">I like this picture, but the foreground object looks too much like a water bottle and thus doesn''t quite fit the scene.  Had it been a liquor bottle, I would have left it in, otherwise I may have cropped differently or removed it. 7</td>', 'I like this picture, but the foreground object looks too much like a water bottle and thus doesn''t quite fit the scene.  Had it been a liquor bottle, I would have left it in, otherwise I may have cropped differently or removed it. 7', '2005-09-01 18:44:23.000000', NULL, 1),
