(1669825, 224052, 26255, '<td valign="top">Power lines are a bit of a distraction and could be cloned out with advanced editing rules.  There seems to be a bit of motion blur on some of the branches maybe due to wind?</td>', 'Power lines are a bit of a distraction and could be cloned out with advanced editing rules.  There seems to be a bit of motion blur on some of the branches maybe due to wind?', '2005-09-02 19:52:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1669827, 222459, 26255, '<td valign="top">Colors are over saturated and blown out in some areas... The image as a whole seems a bit noisy.  I''m being a little harsh because I see so much potential in this image... I would like to see the unedited version.  This one just feels too overprocessed, then again, maybe it''s me.  Oh and..... point off for no "&amp;" or "and" in title.</td>', 'Colors are over saturated and blown out in some areas... The image as a whole seems a bit noisy.  I''m being a little harsh because I see so much potential in this image... I would like to see the unedited version.  This one just feels too overprocessed, then again, maybe it''s me.  Oh and..... point off for no "&" or "and" in title.', '2005-09-02 19:54:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1669831, 224049, 26255, '<td valign="top">Ummm... not to sure about your spelling, may want to check that one.  I love the image though and the water droplets make it.  I''m so so fussy on the spelling, but others may be. - 8</td>', 'Ummm... not to sure about your spelling, may want to check that one.  I love the image though and the water droplets make it.  I''m so so fussy on the spelling, but others may be. - 8', '2005-09-02 19:57:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1669835, 224051, 26255, '<td valign="top">Very cute little girl and I love her expression... Maybe a little more light would help emphasize that.  I''m afraid the title isn''t quite up to my interpretation of the rules....</td>', 'Very cute little girl and I love her expression... Maybe a little more light would help emphasize that.  I''m afraid the title isn''t quite up to my interpretation of the rules....', '2005-09-02 19:59:36.000000', NULL, 1),
