(1670679, 223644, 25355, '<td valign="top">Great colours in  the background and the reflections on the wings. Just a shame that the DOF doesn''t allow the eyes to be sharp, too. Oh what the heck, 10.</td>', 'Great colours in  the background and the reflections on the wings. Just a shame that the DOF doesn''t allow the eyes to be sharp, too. Oh what the heck, 10.', '2005-09-03 08:57:27.000000', NULL, 1),
