(1670787, 223951, 33392, '<td valign="top">A bit dull.  Nice background.  I think it would be a nice shot without the cows (which also would make it not apply to this challenge).  I hope you got a shot of the landscape while you were there.</td>', 'A bit dull.  Nice background.  I think it would be a nice shot without the cows (which also would make it not apply to this challenge).  I hope you got a shot of the landscape while you were there.', '2005-09-03 10:14:36.000000', NULL, 1),
