(1671640, 223730, 13602, '<td valign="top">As much as I like the image the neatimage or noiseninja or whatever you did to it anoyes me. It''s just unnatural looks like freaking plastic doll. I prefere noise no matter in what amount. I''d love to see this without it.</td>', 'As much as I like the image the neatimage or noiseninja or whatever you did to it anoyes me. It''s just unnatural looks like freaking plastic doll. I prefere noise no matter in what amount. I''d love to see this without it.', '2005-09-03 20:13:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1671647, 223987, 2158, '<td valign="top">Nice shot but I think it would have worked better in black and white (or even selective desaturation?).  There just seems to be too much going on in colour.</td>', 'Nice shot but I think it would have worked better in black and white (or even selective desaturation?).  There just seems to be too much going on in colour.', '2005-09-03 20:20:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1671651, 224052, 8891, '<td valign="top">The color of the sky is very fine, as is the framing...sure wish you got rid of those power lines.</td>', 'The color of the sky is very fine, as is the framing...sure wish you got rid of those power lines.', '2005-09-03 20:23:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1671657, 221622, 8891, '<td valign="top">The subject detail and composition are quite impressive. I think the hanging branches at the top left do not add any thing to the this image and they take away from the desolation of the background which adds, for me, to the depression of the image. Damn fine otherwise.</td>', 'The subject detail and composition are quite impressive. I think the hanging branches at the top left do not add any thing to the this image and they take away from the desolation of the background which adds, for me, to the depression of the image. Damn fine otherwise.', '2005-09-03 20:26:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1671660, 223749, 8891, '<td valign="top">This image really got my attentiion in my first look through. THe composition, lighting, textures and colors are excellent. I am, on second/third look bothered only by the blowout of the sky at the top, which is less the 10% of the image, the other 90% is great so we''ll go with a 10 and a fav.</td>', 'This image really got my attentiion in my first look through. THe composition, lighting, textures and colors are excellent. I am, on second/third look bothered only by the blowout of the sky at the top, which is less the 10% of the image, the other 90% is great so we''ll go with a 10 and a fav.', '2005-09-03 20:29:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1671666, 223332, 8891, '<td valign="top">Wow...hmmm...well wow, but hmmmm....It''s a great character study, that''s absolutely certain...I guess the hmmm is coming from the coloring? not sure. I think it might have gone a step or two too far in processing, at least of the subject. The background is fine, but the face of this guy is great and I wouldn''t have messed with it so much, if indeed that is what you did. Like the compostion.</td>', 'Wow...hmmm...well wow, but hmmmm....It''s a great character study, that''s absolutely certain...I guess the hmmm is coming from the coloring? not sure. I think it might have gone a step or two too far in processing, at least of the subject. The background is fine, but the face of this guy is great and I wouldn''t have messed with it so much, if indeed that is what you did. Like the compostion.', '2005-09-03 20:33:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1671668, 223878, 8891, '<td valign="top">A difficult esposure that you have handled nicely. Like that lighting particularly of the mountain or plateau as the cae may be. Great Sky, like all the levels of dark and light and colors.</td>', 'A difficult esposure that you have handled nicely. Like that lighting particularly of the mountain or plateau as the cae may be. Great Sky, like all the levels of dark and light and colors.', '2005-09-03 20:35:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1671672, 224078, 8891, '<td valign="top">Bought a lime...and a lemon...was going to do them with dice....pretty darn close to your idea...Great lighting and very out the box idea, more so than mine. Like what you did with embedding the dimes in the lime. Like the DOF, too. Neat shot. Good luck.</td>', 'Bought a lime...and a lemon...was going to do them with dice....pretty darn close to your idea...Great lighting and very out the box idea, more so than mine. Like what you did with embedding the dimes in the lime. Like the DOF, too. Neat shot. Good luck.', '2005-09-03 20:37:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1671680, 223761, 8891, '<td valign="top">Not sure your title is long enough...but I would be interested in seeing your desciption of the set up and shot infor as well.  Fascinating image! Billions and Billions of stars....sure do miss Sagan.  Good luck!</td>', 'Not sure your title is long enough...but I would be interested in seeing your desciption of the set up and shot infor as well.  Fascinating image! Billions and Billions of stars....sure do miss Sagan.  Good luck!', '2005-09-03 20:39:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1671682, 223689, 8891, '<td valign="top">Wonderful lighting and color and great reflections on the water, love the distortions by the ripples in the lake. Smashing.</td>', 'Wonderful lighting and color and great reflections on the water, love the distortions by the ripples in the lake. Smashing.', '2005-09-03 20:40:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1671686, 223865, 8891, '<td valign="top">Man, when I was a kid, our dentist would do novinas for me to go to the movies as often as I could and eat dots!  They were my favorite movie candy! Not sure about the blue on the licorice or choosing the red...looks like it just good too red too much and needed some more green and yellow intespersed center and right. Thanks for the memories and good luck.</td>', 'Man, when I was a kid, our dentist would do novinas for me to go to the movies as often as I could and eat dots!  They were my favorite movie candy! Not sure about the blue on the licorice or choosing the red...looks like it just good too red too much and needed some more green and yellow intespersed center and right. Thanks for the memories and good luck.', '2005-09-03 20:44:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1671691, 223329, 8891, '<td valign="top">It is, isn''t? Love watching lightning....as dangerous as it is, it sure is a wonder of nature. Like the two story view you got here and you got a lot of strikes in one image. Guess it was a fairly long exposure...did you use a ND filter? More than one or something else....that and an IR are something I''ve been meaning to get. Maybe for the next camera. Great shot and good luck!</td>', 'It is, isn''t? Love watching lightning....as dangerous as it is, it sure is a wonder of nature. Like the two story view you got here and you got a lot of strikes in one image. Guess it was a fairly long exposure...did you use a ND filter? More than one or something else....that and an IR are something I''ve been meaning to get. Maybe for the next camera. Great shot and good luck!', '2005-09-03 20:48:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1671694, 223972, 8891, '<td valign="top">Like your toning, duo tone work and lighting. Good detail but I am not a fan of this long thin crop.</td>', 'Like your toning, duo tone work and lighting. Good detail but I am not a fan of this long thin crop.', '2005-09-03 20:50:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1671699, 223897, 8891, '<td valign="top">Well I get and see the disturbed part, that''s quite evident. The skin tones look a bit off and the lighting is uneven, but he sure does look disturbed, maybe he saw my dairy entry and reacted to it violently...hardly blame him.  Guess the lewd part is out the frame somewhere.</td>', 'Well I get and see the disturbed part, that''s quite evident. The skin tones look a bit off and the lighting is uneven, but he sure does look disturbed, maybe he saw my dairy entry and reacted to it violently...hardly blame him.  Guess the lewd part is out the frame somewhere.', '2005-09-03 20:53:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1671701, 224074, 8891, '<td valign="top">The title is fine and the astroemeria (sic...sorry, always have to look that one up) is a delicate and lovely flower. But your focus is nnot really on the delicate an lovely part, IMO.  A deeper DOF maybe and perhaps more of the flower in the image. Those portruding stamen and/or pistils on lilies of all kinds do make them difficult to shoot when you are right up on top of them.</td>', 'The title is fine and the astroemeria (sic...sorry, always have to look that one up) is a delicate and lovely flower. But your focus is nnot really on the delicate an lovely part, IMO.  A deeper DOF maybe and perhaps more of the flower in the image. Those portruding stamen and/or pistils on lilies of all kinds do make them difficult to shoot when you are right up on top of them.', '2005-09-03 20:56:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1671703, 223417, 37252, '<td valign="top">and how does this say D &amp; L? I''m missing it</td>', 'and how does this say D & L? I''m missing it', '2005-09-03 20:58:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1671724, 222613, 6900, '<td valign="top">I don''t even know if you''re making this up - but great title! :)</td>', 'I don''t even know if you''re making this up - but great title! :)', '2005-09-03 21:13:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1671725, 224030, 6900, '<td valign="top">*gasp*  10.  *gasp*  *breath*  wow....this is breathtaking for real... Hope it wins.</td>', '*gasp*  10.  *gasp*  *breath*  wow....this is breathtaking for real... Hope it wins.', '2005-09-03 21:15:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1671727, 223972, 6900, '<td valign="top">strange pano crop!  weird, but nice image.</td>', 'strange pano crop!  weird, but nice image.', '2005-09-03 21:16:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1671732, 223321, 6900, '<td valign="top">This will probably just make you sad, but if this image was cropped more square and the sun JUST off to either side of the dune, you would have won.  As is, I''m going to guess you''re at about 6.3 to 6.7.  What a great picture!  The unusual crop almost never scores well on DPC.   I do like it, personally.  9.</td>', 'This will probably just make you sad, but if this image was cropped more square and the sun JUST off to either side of the dune, you would have won.  As is, I''m going to guess you''re at about 6.3 to 6.7.  What a great picture!  The unusual crop almost never scores well on DPC.   I do like it, personally.  9.', '2005-09-03 21:17:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1671834, 223642, 10261, '<td valign="top">I have mixed feelings about the knobs on the right edge of the image; overall I think that I''d rather see them either moved a bit further into the frame or cropped out entirely. The light coming over the man''s shoulder is a bit strong, causing the music sheet, his hair and a few of the keys to be overexposed. Adding a light source to the side of the man that''s closer to the camera would have evened out the light enough that you wouldn''t have to sacrifice the highlights.</td>', 'I have mixed feelings about the knobs on the right edge of the image; overall I think that I''d rather see them either moved a bit further into the frame or cropped out entirely. The light coming over the man''s shoulder is a bit strong, causing the music sheet, his hair and a few of the keys to be overexposed. Adding a light source to the side of the man that''s closer to the camera would have evened out the light enough that you wouldn''t have to sacrifice the highlights.', '2005-09-03 22:16:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1671835, 223401, 10261, '<td valign="top">I wish that you hadn''t desaturated the lily pad. The colors on the dragonfly look a little washed out.</td>', 'I wish that you hadn''t desaturated the lily pad. The colors on the dragonfly look a little washed out.', '2005-09-03 22:17:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1671837, 222781, 10261, '<td valign="top">This image would be stronger if there was more contrast in the clouds.</td>', 'This image would be stronger if there was more contrast in the clouds.', '2005-09-03 22:19:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1671838, 223462, 42567, '<td valign="top">awesome!</td>', 'awesome!', '2005-09-03 22:19:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1671842, 224047, 10261, '<td valign="top">The background is a little too busy. A shallower DoF would have helped this shot.</td>', 'The background is a little too busy. A shallower DoF would have helped this shot.', '2005-09-03 22:20:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1671850, 222674, 10261, '<td valign="top">The barrel distortion from the wide angle lens is clearly visible along the horizon. This would be a much stronger composition if the boat in the center had sharper focus.</td>', 'The barrel distortion from the wide angle lens is clearly visible along the horizon. This would be a much stronger composition if the boat in the center had sharper focus.', '2005-09-03 22:23:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1671857, 222635, 10261, '<td valign="top">I don''t care for the frame. Since this was an advanced editing challenge you probably should have cloned out the specks on the leaves. Dodging the background a little bit behind the caterpillar''s antennae would have given them better definition. Good DoF, and overall a nice image.</td>', 'I don''t care for the frame. Since this was an advanced editing challenge you probably should have cloned out the specks on the leaves. Dodging the background a little bit behind the caterpillar''s antennae would have given them better definition. Good DoF, and overall a nice image.', '2005-09-03 22:27:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1671863, 224063, 10261, '<td valign="top">Everything seems to be slightly out of focus, and the wrinkles in the background are a little distracting. Increasing the saturation and contrast would have helped this image.</td>', 'Everything seems to be slightly out of focus, and the wrinkles in the background are a little distracting. Increasing the saturation and contrast would have helped this image.', '2005-09-03 22:30:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1671869, 222767, 10261, '<td valign="top">I would have preferred to see better definition in the legs on the left side of the image; as it is the shallow DoF and light cause the dark legs and black body to merge together somewhat. This is one of the best executed shots that I''ve seen in the challenge so far. Hopefully the other voters won''t penalize you too much for the subject.</td>', 'I would have preferred to see better definition in the legs on the left side of the image; as it is the shallow DoF and light cause the dark legs and black body to merge together somewhat. This is one of the best executed shots that I''ve seen in the challenge so far. Hopefully the other voters won''t penalize you too much for the subject.', '2005-09-03 22:35:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1671870, 222247, 10261, '<td valign="top">This is the 53rd image I''ve seen, and the 11th with this title. The soft focus looks intentional, but I think that it would have been a stronger image if the focus was sharper.</td>', 'This is the 53rd image I''ve seen, and the 11th with this title. The soft focus looks intentional, but I think that it would have been a stronger image if the focus was sharper.', '2005-09-03 22:37:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1671872, 223417, 10261, '<td valign="top">This image would be stronger if there was a clear subject to focus on.</td>', 'This image would be stronger if there was a clear subject to focus on.', '2005-09-03 22:39:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1671874, 222766, 10261, '<td valign="top">Interesting high key shot.</td>', 'Interesting high key shot.', '2005-09-03 22:39:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1671876, 223953, 37544, '<td valign="top">I love this! I think thats its great. I wish you would have played a little with the colors and contrast to give it a more dramatic look, good job!</td>', 'I love this! I think thats its great. I wish you would have played a little with the colors and contrast to give it a more dramatic look, good job!', '2005-09-03 22:40:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1671878, 221746, 10261, '<td valign="top">This appears to have been lit by a flash, which caused the objects surrounding the camera to be better lit than your intended subject. A light source behind the person would help to separate them from the surrounding darkness, while preserving the atmosphere.</td>', 'This appears to have been lit by a flash, which caused the objects surrounding the camera to be better lit than your intended subject. A light source behind the person would help to separate them from the surrounding darkness, while preserving the atmosphere.', '2005-09-03 22:42:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1671881, 223852, 10261, '<td valign="top">The downtown lights look overexposed. The silhouettes of the trees would have been much stronger against a sky with more clouds; in lieu of that painting them with light might have produced interesting results as well.</td>', 'The downtown lights look overexposed. The silhouettes of the trees would have been much stronger against a sky with more clouds; in lieu of that painting them with light might have produced interesting results as well.', '2005-09-03 22:45:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1671889, 224086, 10261, '<td valign="top">Increasing the contrast and toning down the bright white shirt would give this image a boost. The crop seems a little more aggressive than I like. I''d rather see either their faces filling the frame or include a bit more context; chopping off the father''s scalp and the back of the daughter''s hand gives this a slightly claustrophobic feel.</td>', 'Increasing the contrast and toning down the bright white shirt would give this image a boost. The crop seems a little more aggressive than I like. I''d rather see either their faces filling the frame or include a bit more context; chopping off the father''s scalp and the back of the daughter''s hand gives this a slightly claustrophobic feel.', '2005-09-03 22:49:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1671894, 222752, 10261, '<td valign="top">This looks like a snapshot. The harsh light from the flash isn''t particularly flattering for either of the subjects.</td>', 'This looks like a snapshot. The harsh light from the flash isn''t particularly flattering for either of the subjects.', '2005-09-03 22:50:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1671897, 224039, 10261, '<td valign="top">This looks over processed and out of focus.</td>', 'This looks over processed and out of focus.', '2005-09-03 22:50:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1671913, 223445, 10261, '<td valign="top">This isn''t a title I expected to see, nor is it the image that I would have expected given the title. The scene exceeds the dynamic range of your camera on both ends, leaving the dark coat underexposed and the saddle blanket and numbers overexposed. <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/tutorial.php?TUTORIAL_ID=20" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">This tutorial</a> may have helped you to retrieve some of the missing information in these regions.</td>', 'This isn''t a title I expected to see, nor is it the image that I would have expected given the title. The scene exceeds the dynamic range of your camera on both ends, leaving the dark coat underexposed and the saddle blanket and numbers overexposed. This tutorial may have helped you to retrieve some of the missing information in these regions.', '2005-09-03 22:54:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1671935, 222906, 10261, '<td valign="top">A little more light on the near side of the woman would have helped to even out the illumination. Including her lower half might have improved the image.</td>', 'A little more light on the near side of the woman would have helped to even out the illumination. Including her lower half might have improved the image.', '2005-09-03 22:59:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1671940, 224053, 10261, '<td valign="top">This looks like it was sharpened way too much. This shot was well executed.</td>', 'This looks like it was sharpened way too much. This shot was well executed.', '2005-09-03 23:00:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1671969, 222269, 10261, '<td valign="top">It may just be the lack of context, but this image appears to have quite a bit of barrel distortion. The only substantial features in the image are the top edge of the door and the handle, and somehow their impact seems to be negated rather than accentuated by the emptiness which dominates the rest of the image. I can''t identify anything that causes the minimalism to not work here, but I think that it would work better if the two features were closer together, reducing the amount of negative space which they have to offset.</td>', 'It may just be the lack of context, but this image appears to have quite a bit of barrel distortion. The only substantial features in the image are the top edge of the door and the handle, and somehow their impact seems to be negated rather than accentuated by the emptiness which dominates the rest of the image. I can''t identify anything that causes the minimalism to not work here, but I think that it would work better if the two features were closer together, reducing the amount of negative space which they have to offset.', '2005-09-03 23:09:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1671973, 223475, 10261, '<td valign="top">Nicely done; the reflection adds a lot to the image.</td>', 'Nicely done; the reflection adds a lot to the image.', '2005-09-03 23:10:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1671988, 222755, 10261, '<td valign="top">The title seems like a real stretch; I suspect that this would score much higher if the title didn''t work against you. The fact that the cells in the grid aren''t completely square is accentuated by the way you''ve cropped the image. Even if the windows really aren''t rectangular I think that using perspective correction to make them so would have resulted in a more pleasing image. This is one of my favorite images in the challenge so far.</td>', 'The title seems like a real stretch; I suspect that this would score much higher if the title didn''t work against you. The fact that the cells in the grid aren''t completely square is accentuated by the way you''ve cropped the image. Even if the windows really aren''t rectangular I think that using perspective correction to make them so would have resulted in a more pleasing image. This is one of my favorite images in the challenge so far.', '2005-09-03 23:14:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1672001, 223953, 10261, '<td valign="top">The direction that your model is facing makes this image feel unbalanced. I''d rather see this framed to place him on the other side of the frame of have him turn and face the other direction.</td>', 'The direction that your model is facing makes this image feel unbalanced. I''d rather see this framed to place him on the other side of the frame of have him turn and face the other direction.', '2005-09-03 23:16:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1672012, 223421, 10261, '<td valign="top">The white powder is overexposed, and the rest of the image is underexposed. Better light would do a lot for this image.</td>', 'The white powder is overexposed, and the rest of the image is underexposed. Better light would do a lot for this image.', '2005-09-03 23:18:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1672022, 223730, 37961, '<td valign="top">Wonderful Lighting and subject. Title is right on also.</td>', 'Wonderful Lighting and subject. Title is right on also.', '2005-09-03 23:19:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1672027, 223763, 37961, '<td valign="top">Great color tones, focus and composition. I want a drink!</td>', 'Great color tones, focus and composition. I want a drink!', '2005-09-03 23:19:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1672038, 223418, 10261, '<td valign="top">The title is quite a stretch. The border detracts from the image. This would be a stronger photograph if there was a clear subject; sunrises  are so common that they lack impact without something to fixate on.</td>', 'The title is quite a stretch. The border detracts from the image. This would be a stronger photograph if there was a clear subject; sunrises  are so common that they lack impact without something to fixate on.', '2005-09-03 23:21:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1672047, 223352, 10261, '<td valign="top">This looks over-processed; I would have preferred straight sepia and perhaps a little bit of noise.</td>', 'This looks over-processed; I would have preferred straight sepia and perhaps a little bit of noise.', '2005-09-03 23:23:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1672055, 223877, 10261, '<td valign="top">I would have preferred to have a slightly wider DoF.</td>', 'I would have preferred to have a slightly wider DoF.', '2005-09-03 23:24:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1672073, 223868, 10261, '<td valign="top">I find the background a little distracting. I don''t normally care for selective desaturation, but I think that it works fairly well here. The lemons look almost peach colored; hue shifting them a bit closer to true yellow would have given this more of a kick.</td>', 'I find the background a little distracting. I don''t normally care for selective desaturation, but I think that it works fairly well here. The lemons look almost peach colored; hue shifting them a bit closer to true yellow would have given this more of a kick.', '2005-09-03 23:27:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1672091, 223955, 10261, '<td valign="top">Focusing on either (1) the drain and surrounding bricks or (2) the blocked fire exit might have resulted in some interesting images. But as currently presented this isn''t a particularly interesting scene.</td>', 'Focusing on either (1) the drain and surrounding bricks or (2) the blocked fire exit might have resulted in some interesting images. But as currently presented this isn''t a particularly interesting scene.', '2005-09-03 23:31:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1672117, 223486, 10261, '<td valign="top">The text on the open dictionary, particularly that seen through the glasses, looks fake, perhaps as a result of oversharpening. The illumination and color draw my eyes to the bottom right corner of the image, and it took me a moment to realize that the glasses were the intended focal point. This is a solid concept; better illumination, a shallower DoF and perhaps converting this to B&amp;W could have made this a ribbon contender.</td>', 'The text on the open dictionary, particularly that seen through the glasses, looks fake, perhaps as a result of oversharpening. The illumination and color draw my eyes to the bottom right corner of the image, and it took me a moment to realize that the glasses were the intended focal point. This is a solid concept; better illumination, a shallower DoF and perhaps converting this to B&W could have made this a ribbon contender.', '2005-09-03 23:36:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1672132, 223452, 10261, '<td valign="top">The irony and novelty factors are both quite high in this image. However, the dog''s position makes the lingerie hard to recognize.</td>', 'The irony and novelty factors are both quite high in this image. However, the dog''s position makes the lingerie hard to recognize.', '2005-09-03 23:39:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1672144, 224023, 10261, '<td valign="top">This is the most dramatic of the 15 images captioned "Dark &amp; Light" that I''ve seen so far in this challenge. The horizon doesn''t appear to be level; the silhouette of the buildings doesn''t provide me with much perspective information, so the unbalanced profile is primarily responsible for this feeling. The clouds and architectural profile complement one another. My only suggestion would be to dodge &amp; burn the cloud at 1 o''clock a bit to bring it back from being a patch of flat grey.</td>', 'This is the most dramatic of the 15 images captioned "Dark & Light" that I''ve seen so far in this challenge. The horizon doesn''t appear to be level; the silhouette of the buildings doesn''t provide me with much perspective information, so the unbalanced profile is primarily responsible for this feeling. The clouds and architectural profile complement one another. My only suggestion would be to dodge & burn the cloud at 1 o''clock a bit to bring it back from being a patch of flat grey.', '2005-09-03 23:42:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1672159, 223948, 10261, '<td valign="top">Are those specks sheep? I really like this image, but I think that I''d prefer to either see the sheep cloned out or the foreground cropped out to allow me to see enough detail to verify that those are sheep.</td>', 'Are those specks sheep? I really like this image, but I think that I''d prefer to either see the sheep cloned out or the foreground cropped out to allow me to see enough detail to verify that those are sheep.', '2005-09-03 23:45:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1672161, 222613, 10261, '<td valign="top">Higher contrast and burning out the window a little bit to bring out the patterns in the smoke would have given this image an added kick.</td>', 'Higher contrast and burning out the window a little bit to bring out the patterns in the smoke would have given this image an added kick.', '2005-09-03 23:46:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1672166, 223627, 10261, '<td valign="top">Increasing the contrast and altering the saturation (either pushing up the blue by +-20% or converting this to B&amp;W) would have given this image a boost.</td>', 'Increasing the contrast and altering the saturation (either pushing up the blue by +-20% or converting this to B&W) would have given this image a boost.', '2005-09-03 23:49:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1672174, 224085, 10261, '<td valign="top">Adding a hair light to the dandelion would have helped to separate it from the lily. I don''t care for the warm color cast. A slightly closer crop would have rendered this an abstract (which I like, but they often don''t do well at DPC). I really like this concept.</td>', 'Adding a hair light to the dandelion would have helped to separate it from the lily. I don''t care for the warm color cast. A slightly closer crop would have rendered this an abstract (which I like, but they often don''t do well at DPC). I really like this concept.', '2005-09-03 23:53:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1672179, 222903, 10261, '<td valign="top">With a composition so minimalistic I''d like to see either sharp focus or a visible reason for the soft focus. If the focus were softer still this might make an interesting abstract.</td>', 'With a composition so minimalistic I''d like to see either sharp focus or a visible reason for the soft focus. If the focus were softer still this might make an interesting abstract.', '2005-09-03 23:55:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1672183, 223370, 10261, '<td valign="top">The sharpening and selective desaturation make the D look pasted in, which detracts from the photo''s impact.</td>', 'The sharpening and selective desaturation make the D look pasted in, which detracts from the photo''s impact.', '2005-09-03 23:57:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1672197, 222739, 10261, '<td valign="top">I would like this better if there were some reference point which allowed me to get a sense of scale.</td>', 'I would like this better if there were some reference point which allowed me to get a sense of scale.', '2005-09-04 00:02:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1672201, 221527, 19248, '<td valign="top">looks like a  wrinkled Blackjack felt.  The wrinkle is a distraction.</td>', 'looks like a  wrinkled Blackjack felt.  The wrinkle is a distraction.', '2005-09-04 00:06:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1672206, 223418, 19248, '<td valign="top">the border diminishes the pic IMO</td>', 'the border diminishes the pic IMO', '2005-09-04 00:06:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1672207, 224038, 10261, '<td valign="top">If the the dumbbell had a rougher texture you would have an interesting contrast between it and the lace. Without that contrast the combination of these two objects seems random.</td>', 'If the the dumbbell had a rougher texture you would have an interesting contrast between it and the lace. Without that contrast the combination of these two objects seems random.', '2005-09-04 00:07:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1672208, 223893, 19248, '<td valign="top">nice shot the colors are vibrant.</td>', 'nice shot the colors are vibrant.', '2005-09-04 00:07:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1672211, 223548, 19248, '<td valign="top">Looks like it was shot against a backdrop.  Nice DOF.</td>', 'Looks like it was shot against a backdrop.  Nice DOF.', '2005-09-04 00:08:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1672215, 222269, 19248, '<td valign="top">Meets the challenge, the coloring of the door is good.  Subject is rather dull IMO.</td>', 'Meets the challenge, the coloring of the door is good.  Subject is rather dull IMO.', '2005-09-04 00:10:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1672218, 224023, 19248, '<td valign="top">Why the border to an otherwise great picture.</td>', 'Why the border to an otherwise great picture.', '2005-09-04 00:10:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1672221, 223462, 10261, '<td valign="top">This looks a little oversharpened, and the lack of texture on the face makes the model look somewhat plastic and artificial. Something about the large spot running from the edge of the eye looks odd. The lighting is good, and the catchlight draws attention to her eyes with good effect; the DoF is good. Nicely done Annah.</td>', 'This looks a little oversharpened, and the lack of texture on the face makes the model look somewhat plastic and artificial. Something about the large spot running from the edge of the eye looks odd. The lighting is good, and the catchlight draws attention to her eyes with good effect; the DoF is good. Nicely done Annah.', '2005-09-04 00:12:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1672223, 223869, 19248, '<td valign="top">Give you a point for originality, not sure if the broom is out of focus because its moving....</td>', 'Give you a point for originality, not sure if the broom is out of focus because its moving....', '2005-09-04 00:12:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1672225, 223948, 19248, '<td valign="top">Works on a lot of levels.  the clouds the sunlight, the sheep, the shadows, the mountains.  Well done</td>', 'Works on a lot of levels.  the clouds the sunlight, the sheep, the shadows, the mountains.  Well done', '2005-09-04 00:13:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1672228, 224039, 19248, '<td valign="top">Meets the challenge but the subject is rather dull IMO.  Also looks like you oversaturated the lighted areas.</td>', 'Meets the challenge but the subject is rather dull IMO.  Also looks like you oversaturated the lighted areas.', '2005-09-04 00:14:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1672231, 223321, 19248, '<td valign="top">Daybreak  would be an appropriate word for the title.  Love the picture, the colors are marvelous &amp; the use of light &amp; shadow is great.</td>', 'Daybreak  would be an appropriate word for the title.  Love the picture, the colors are marvelous & the use of light & shadow is great.', '2005-09-04 00:16:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1672237, 223862, 19248, '<td valign="top">good concept, though I''dput lace undergarments  or a lace kerchief with denim rather than a doillie.</td>', 'good concept, though I''dput lace undergarments  or a lace kerchief with denim rather than a doillie.', '2005-09-04 00:18:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1672238, 223307, 19248, '<td valign="top">seems like a snapshot to me.</td>', 'seems like a snapshot to me.', '2005-09-04 00:18:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1672241, 222739, 19248, '<td valign="top">Good take on the challenge.  might be my monitor but the skylight appears oblong, not circular.</td>', 'Good take on the challenge.  might be my monitor but the skylight appears oblong, not circular.', '2005-09-04 00:20:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1672244, 223479, 19248, '<td valign="top">Cool idea, well rendered, don''t care for the border though.</td>', 'Cool idea, well rendered, don''t care for the border though.', '2005-09-04 00:21:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1672246, 223947, 10261, '<td valign="top">This is a wonderful landscape photo. I have mixed feelings about the model; her inclusion in the frame competes with my attention to the mountains behind her, but she does seem to add balance to the water section of the image. If the DoF were shallow enough that the mountains weren''t in focus, I think that her presence would work well. Shooting this as mountains + water or water + girl would produce a balanced feel, but including all three feels slightly off.</td>', 'This is a wonderful landscape photo. I have mixed feelings about the model; her inclusion in the frame competes with my attention to the mountains behind her, but she does seem to add balance to the water section of the image. If the DoF were shallow enough that the mountains weren''t in focus, I think that her presence would work well. Shooting this as mountains + water or water + girl would produce a balanced feel, but including all three feels slightly off.', '2005-09-04 00:21:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1672251, 224076, 19248, '<td valign="top">Meets the challenge,  wish the lime was centered with the dartboard.</td>', 'Meets the challenge,  wish the lime was centered with the dartboard.', '2005-09-04 00:23:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1672252, 223553, 3569, '<td valign="top">wonderful snake</td>', 'wonderful snake', '2005-09-04 00:23:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1672254, 224002, 3569, '<td valign="top">Nice mammatus, next time move away from the powerlines though</td>', 'Nice mammatus, next time move away from the powerlines though', '2005-09-04 00:24:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1672257, 223219, 19248, '<td valign="top">Don''t see despair in the facail expression IMO. Maybe Despondant.   Still a good idea &amp; take on the challenge.</td>', 'Don''t see despair in the facail expression IMO. Maybe Despondant.   Still a good idea & take on the challenge.', '2005-09-04 00:24:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1672260, 223869, 10261, '<td valign="top">The combination of these elements seems random. If the colors, textures, shapes, or other features clearly complemented each other this would feel more natural; as it is this seems like objects were selected purely for their relation to the topic.</td>', 'The combination of these elements seems random. If the colors, textures, shapes, or other features clearly complemented each other this would feel more natural; as it is this seems like objects were selected purely for their relation to the topic.', '2005-09-04 00:25:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1672262, 222225, 3569, '<td valign="top">Distant Larus(gulls) would have work better as a title.  Shots nice though.</td>', 'Distant Larus(gulls) would have work better as a title.  Shots nice though.', '2005-09-04 00:25:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1672263, 223206, 19248, '<td valign="top">LMAO.  Good shot, &amp; it fits the challenge.  Even like the border, which is rare for me.</td>', 'LMAO.  Good shot, & it fits the challenge.  Even like the border, which is rare for me.', '2005-09-04 00:25:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1672264, 223376, 19248, '<td valign="top">How about Denim &amp; Leather.</td>', 'How about Denim & Leather.', '2005-09-04 00:26:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1672267, 223295, 19248, '<td valign="top">Wonderful Macro, I like seeing the few remaining pollen heads.</td>', 'Wonderful Macro, I like seeing the few remaining pollen heads.', '2005-09-04 00:27:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1672270, 223826, 10261, '<td valign="top">The power lines detract from the image.</td>', 'The power lines detract from the image.', '2005-09-04 00:27:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1672271, 222123, 3569, '<td valign="top">wonderful swallow tails and swamp milkweed.</td>', 'wonderful swallow tails and swamp milkweed.', '2005-09-04 00:27:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1672273, 223462, 19248, '<td valign="top">Moving image.  Among my favorites in this challenge.</td>', 'Moving image.  Among my favorites in this challenge.', '2005-09-04 00:28:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1672275, 221984, 10261, '<td valign="top">The sharpening halos are distracting.</td>', 'The sharpening halos are distracting.', '2005-09-04 00:29:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1672278, 223452, 3569, '<td valign="top">kind of silly, but fun</td>', 'kind of silly, but fun', '2005-09-04 00:29:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1672279, 223644, 19248, '<td valign="top">good shot, would have benefitted from a greater DOF, &amp; longer shutter speed.</td>', 'good shot, would have benefitted from a greater DOF, & longer shutter speed.', '2005-09-04 00:30:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1672281, 223417, 19248, '<td valign="top">Am I missing the D&amp;L aspect?</td>', 'Am I missing the D&L aspect?', '2005-09-04 00:31:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1672282, 223215, 10261, '<td valign="top">Somehow the desaturation makes those look less like lollipops. I think that this would have been better in color.</td>', 'Somehow the desaturation makes those look less like lollipops. I think that this would have been better in color.', '2005-09-04 00:31:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1672284, 222187, 19248, '<td valign="top">Interesting take on the challenge.</td>', 'Interesting take on the challenge.', '2005-09-04 00:32:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1672287, 223319, 10261, '<td valign="top">This image lacks a clear point of interest.</td>', 'This image lacks a clear point of interest.', '2005-09-04 00:34:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1672292, 223243, 10261, '<td valign="top">I like the leading lines of the lamps. This image would be stronger if there was something at the end of the trail of lamps. I find the uneven horizon distracting.</td>', 'I like the leading lines of the lamps. This image would be stronger if there was something at the end of the trail of lamps. I find the uneven horizon distracting.', '2005-09-04 00:36:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1672294, 223713, 19248, '<td valign="top">I  ike the sky, but the image would be better with  the observatory cropped out IMO.</td>', 'I  ike the sky, but the image would be better with  the observatory cropped out IMO.', '2005-09-04 00:36:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1672296, 224030, 3569, '<td valign="top">beautiful</td>', 'beautiful', '2005-09-04 00:37:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1672298, 224069, 19248, '<td valign="top">interesting take on the challenge.</td>', 'interesting take on the challenge.', '2005-09-04 00:37:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1672300, 223325, 19248, '<td valign="top">Well conveyed image.</td>', 'Well conveyed image.', '2005-09-04 00:38:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1672303, 223951, 19248, '<td valign="top">Dairy I think.  Good take on the challenge.</td>', 'Dairy I think.  Good take on the challenge.', '2005-09-04 00:40:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1672304, 223866, 3569, '<td valign="top">wonderful Sonoran scene</td>', 'wonderful Sonoran scene', '2005-09-04 00:42:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1672310, 224004, 3569, '<td valign="top">great sharpness and natural look</td>', 'great sharpness and natural look', '2005-09-04 00:43:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1672369, 223711, 34763, '<td valign="top">very touching</td>', 'very touching', '2005-09-04 01:41:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1672373, 224086, 34763, '<td valign="top">Why do dads always cry when this happens? I went through it with a daughter two years ago, now have a brand new grandaughter so I guess it was worth it ;)  10 from me!</td>', 'Why do dads always cry when this happens? I went through it with a daughter two years ago, now have a brand new grandaughter so I guess it was worth it ;)  10 from me!', '2005-09-04 01:42:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1672375, 223730, 34763, '<td valign="top">perfection with cintrast, color and tone 10!</td>', 'perfection with cintrast, color and tone 10!', '2005-09-04 01:43:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1672396, 222225, 19035, '<td valign="top">Beautiful Picture, painfully long title.  7.</td>', 'Beautiful Picture, painfully long title.  7.', '2005-09-04 01:58:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1672397, 223332, 19035, '<td valign="top">Wonderfuly Grainy and Dark, reminds me of something Joey Lawrence would shoot.  8.</td>', 'Wonderfuly Grainy and Dark, reminds me of something Joey Lawrence would shoot.  8.', '2005-09-04 01:59:59.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(1672400, 223242, 19035, '<td valign="top">A big 10 to start this new life - good luck!</td>', 'A big 10 to start this new life - good luck!', '2005-09-04 02:02:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1672407, 223452, 19035, '<td valign="top">so funny and so wrong...heh</td>', 'so funny and so wrong...heh', '2005-09-04 02:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1672411, 223479, 39243, '<td valign="top">wow! what a great photo! I hope you put up a How To on this one. Unless you hit this rose with a heat gun ... ummm 9</td>', 'wow! what a great photo! I hope you put up a How To on this one. Unless you hit this rose with a heat gun ... ummm 9', '2005-09-04 02:12:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1672412, 224030, 39243, '<td valign="top">stunning - great for a postcard challenge too! 9</td>', 'stunning - great for a postcard challenge too! 9', '2005-09-04 02:12:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1672414, 223445, 39243, '<td valign="top">beautiful clarity - great moment of capture. 9</td>', 'beautiful clarity - great moment of capture. 9', '2005-09-04 02:13:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1672420, 223417, 39243, '<td valign="top">my guess is your are getting hammered on this photo. I probably need not say more. GL -----   1</td>', 'my guess is your are getting hammered on this photo. I probably need not say more. GL -----   1', '2005-09-04 02:19:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1672422, 223747, 39243, '<td valign="top">beautifull 8</td>', 'beautifull 8', '2005-09-04 02:19:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1672424, 223852, 39243, '<td valign="top">didn''t I just view this in a thread? Maybe I am just seeing the photo for the second time. anyway - beautiful 8</td>', 'didn''t I just view this in a thread? Maybe I am just seeing the photo for the second time. anyway - beautiful 8', '2005-09-04 02:20:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1672463, 224026, 25397, '<td valign="top">very cool</td>', 'very cool', '2005-09-04 03:05:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1672464, 222906, 25397, '<td valign="top">Wow, if this is candid, you are one sneaky mother fucker.<br/>If this is set up, you are one clever mother fucker.<br/>Scuse the swearing, I curse when I''m excited.</td>', 'Wow, if this is candid, you are one sneaky mother fucker.If this is set up, you are one clever mother fucker.Scuse the swearing, I curse when I''m excited.', '2005-09-04 03:07:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1672469, 223462, 25397, '<td valign="top">good composition and such annah, but the oversoftness ruins it for me. the dots look like welts on your face because of the tone edges. I''ll still vote pretty high though :-D</td>', 'good composition and such annah, but the oversoftness ruins it for me. the dots look like welts on your face because of the tone edges. I''ll still vote pretty high though :-D', '2005-09-04 03:10:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1672470, 224077, 25397, '<td valign="top">perfect</td>', 'perfect', '2005-09-04 03:11:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1672471, 222613, 25397, '<td valign="top">perfect title, very effective :-)</td>', 'perfect title, very effective :-)', '2005-09-04 03:11:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1672473, 223992, 25397, '<td valign="top">Amazing, everything is perfect except the contrast. If you did something as simple as raising the contrast about 15-20 points, it would have had a lot more impact. But I dunno, 10 anyway.   :-D</td>', 'Amazing, everything is perfect except the contrast. If you did something as simple as raising the contrast about 15-20 points, it would have had a lot more impact. But I dunno, 10 anyway.   :-D', '2005-09-04 03:14:14.000000', NULL, 1),
