(1673413, 223742, 41675, '<td valign="top">I really like the lighting and the reflections you captured. I wonder how this same photo would look with the red building on the right cropped out? My eyes are continually drawn off to the stronger color.</td>', 'I really like the lighting and the reflections you captured. I wonder how this same photo would look with the red building on the right cropped out? My eyes are continually drawn off to the stronger color.', '2005-09-04 19:21:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1673422, 223267, 42984, '<td valign="top">Wow, what a stunner.  There are so many captivating elements to it.  The lighting of course is stunning, the composition really reall works.   You have placed those styrene rocks perfectly :)  The one in the foreground leads you to the hero fof the shot, the island and the one on the left is significant because it breaks the horizon line and gives the whole pic depth.  The sky is perfect for the shot mood and finally the sureal look of the water in the foreground just punctuates the whole effect. If I could vote, it would be a 10</td>', 'Wow, what a stunner.  There are so many captivating elements to it.  The lighting of course is stunning, the composition really reall works.   You have placed those styrene rocks perfectly :)  The one in the foreground leads you to the hero fof the shot, the island and the one on the left is significant because it breaks the horizon line and gives the whole pic depth.  The sky is perfect for the shot mood and finally the sureal look of the water in the foreground just punctuates the whole effect. If I could vote, it would be a 10', '2005-09-04 19:33:02.000000', NULL, 1),
