(1673587, 223711, 8891, '<td valign="top">This made an impression on me when I first saw it and I must say that I''m not quite sure what to make of it. It sort of looks staged and part of me is really hoping that it is and, if so, you know some great actors. I am trying to process the idea that it is not staged and cannot imagine the where with all that you had to summon up to be able to take this at that moment and still get a very good image out it. Questions abound so no matter the circumstances, it really does work for me.</td>', 'This made an impression on me when I first saw it and I must say that I''m not quite sure what to make of it. It sort of looks staged and part of me is really hoping that it is and, if so, you know some great actors. I am trying to process the idea that it is not staged and cannot imagine the where with all that you had to summon up to be able to take this at that moment and still get a very good image out it. Questions abound so no matter the circumstances, it really does work for me.', '2005-09-04 20:34:33.000000', NULL, 1),
