(1673751, 224023, 35804, '<td valign="top">Really dramatic! I love the colors...though I know this is a sunset, the image really does have a great abstractness about it.</td>', 'Really dramatic! I love the colors...though I know this is a sunset, the image really does have a great abstractness about it.', '2005-09-04 22:03:09.000000', NULL, 1),
