(1673761, 223329, 18197, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot. Well captured. Well processed and presented. You''ve made me feel and smell the storm. Thanks!</td>', 'Beautiful shot. Well captured. Well processed and presented. You''ve made me feel and smell the storm. Thanks!', '2005-09-04 22:07:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1673764, 223249, 18197, '<td valign="top">Tremendous image. You have captured very well the emotional payload this man carries. Lit perfectly to capture the character of his face.</td>', 'Tremendous image. You have captured very well the emotional payload this man carries. Lit perfectly to capture the character of his face.', '2005-09-04 22:09:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1673765, 222755, 25355, '<td valign="top">I know the feeling. But what gets me - why is there a rocking chair in the airport??</td>', 'I know the feeling. But what gets me - why is there a rocking chair in the airport??', '2005-09-04 22:09:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1673766, 224049, 35804, '<td valign="top">Pretty pinks...very "sweet"...I''m not sure about the cropping, I keep wanting to see either a tighter crop or a "looser" crop...a tighter crop might be interesting because the flower would take on a more abstract appearance...but a looser crop, with more of the deep burgundy background surrounding the flower showing, that dahlia would just LEAP off the "page" so to speak...pink can be such a powerful color.</td>', 'Pretty pinks...very "sweet"...I''m not sure about the cropping, I keep wanting to see either a tighter crop or a "looser" crop...a tighter crop might be interesting because the flower would take on a more abstract appearance...but a looser crop, with more of the deep burgundy background surrounding the flower showing, that dahlia would just LEAP off the "page" so to speak...pink can be such a powerful color.', '2005-09-04 22:10:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1673767, 223267, 18197, '<td valign="top">I have visited this beautiful place and your image does it justice. Thank you for reminding me of its beauty.</td>', 'I have visited this beautiful place and your image does it justice. Thank you for reminding me of its beauty.', '2005-09-04 22:10:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1673770, 223972, 13688, '<td valign="top">your choice for all that space below the ear is very intriguing.  The fine hairs are a bit distracting</td>', 'your choice for all that space below the ear is very intriguing.  The fine hairs are a bit distracting', '2005-09-04 22:11:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1673771, 221537, 18197, '<td valign="top">This is elegant in its simplicity. Well captured and presented. Highlights on the road are terrific. Contrast makes this truely dramatic.</td>', 'This is elegant in its simplicity. Well captured and presented. Highlights on the road are terrific. Contrast makes this truely dramatic.', '2005-09-04 22:11:19.000000', NULL, 1),
