(1674687, 224070, 40370, '<td valign="top">Wow, this picture came by accident after about 50 other "dog &amp; lake" shots. I''ve learned no matter how you set up a photo, nature is in control of the lighting and atmosphere, movement of the subject etc. <br/>I am such a novice with Photoshop, I feel proud that this photo is in the top ten with very little post-work, just de-saturated a little of the natural blue (incredible colors after a hail storm) and sharpened his (my dog Ruger)fur a little. Thank you for all the positive comments, last Tuesday was exhilarating when the score crept up and up.</td>', 'Wow, this picture came by accident after about 50 other "dog & lake" shots. I''ve learned no matter how you set up a photo, nature is in control of the lighting and atmosphere, movement of the subject etc. I am such a novice with Photoshop, I feel proud that this photo is in the top ten with very little post-work, just de-saturated a little of the natural blue (incredible colors after a hail storm) and sharpened his (my dog Ruger)fur a little. Thank you for all the positive comments, last Tuesday was exhilarating when the score crept up and up.', '2005-09-05 01:46:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(1674732, 223730, 22734, '<td valign="top">This got my 9 and then a bump to 10. Manny: you are indeed a wonder revealing untold beauty with so much warmth and wonder. You remain virtually unrivaled when it comes to capturing the essence of beauty.<br/> <br/>My warmest congratulations on receiving the Blue for this challenge.</td>', 'This got my 9 and then a bump to 10. Manny: you are indeed a wonder revealing untold beauty with so much warmth and wonder. You remain virtually unrivaled when it comes to capturing the essence of beauty. My warmest congratulations on receiving the Blue for this challenge.', '2005-09-05 01:50:50.000000', NULL, 0),
