(1674788, 223730, 14386, '<td valign="top">I am typing this in-between classes.  Thank you so much everyone.  I didn''t expect it to win much more to get an 8 + .   I felt I tried so much to fit it on a D and L theme and felt short.  Pupae was also a greenhorn in posing.  <br/> <br/>And yes, she will be in my next class.  She will be surprised to see herself in the page of DPC.<br/> <br/>Salamat.  After 3 dismal scores in the challenges, this is what I need.<br/> <br/>Manny</td>', 'I am typing this in-between classes.  Thank you so much everyone.  I didn''t expect it to win much more to get an 8 + .   I felt I tried so much to fit it on a D and L theme and felt short.  Pupae was also a greenhorn in posing.   And yes, she will be in my next class.  She will be surprised to see herself in the page of DPC. Salamat.  After 3 dismal scores in the challenges, this is what I need. Manny', '2005-09-05 01:59:03.000000', NULL, 0),
