(1674941, 224070, 37961, '<td valign="top">This is a lovely photo. Very unusual the way you caputured it, who would think to photograph a dog from the upper back like that. The colors and setting is perfect. Congrats on your high placement.</td>', 'This is a lovely photo. Very unusual the way you caputured it, who would think to photograph a dog from the upper back like that. The colors and setting is perfect. Congrats on your high placement.', '2005-09-05 02:29:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(1674973, 223711, 27133, '<td valign="top">I am so sorry to hear of your loss.  It is a great image that will remain with you forever...but with it you will have wonderful memories of time with your mum.<br/> <br/>Judi</td>', 'I am so sorry to hear of your loss.  It is a great image that will remain with you forever...but with it you will have wonderful memories of time with your mum. Judi', '2005-09-05 02:45:18.000000', NULL, 0),
