(1675473, 223267, 3087, '<td valign="top">Didn''t view the D&amp;L ones before results were posted - so what a delight to see this one! It''s a lovely image of a beautiful place - and your decision to use all the ND filters and get that long exposure and hence that milky effect in the water, works really well. As does the red morning light on the mount against the darkness nearer to shore. Wonderful!</td>', 'Didn''t view the D&L ones before results were posted - so what a delight to see this one! It''s a lovely image of a beautiful place - and your decision to use all the ND filters and get that long exposure and hence that milky effect in the water, works really well. As does the red morning light on the mount against the darkness nearer to shore. Wonderful!', '2005-09-05 11:00:45.000000', NULL, 0),
