(1679306, 223462, 24013, '<td valign="top">lovely portrait.<br/> <br/>i have to agree that the editing is a little sloppy.  i would love to have seen how it looks without the gaussian.  the edges around the makeup makes them look to me a bit like wounds.<br/> <br/>having said that, i have to jump on board with all that admiration.  the lighting is fantastic. and the crop worked out really well.  you''re certainly photogenic.  great eyes, and catchlights in them.  and nice artistic job on the eyeliner and all.  very creative.</td>', 'lovely portrait. i have to agree that the editing is a little sloppy.  i would love to have seen how it looks without the gaussian.  the edges around the makeup makes them look to me a bit like wounds. having said that, i have to jump on board with all that admiration.  the lighting is fantastic. and the crop worked out really well.  you''re certainly photogenic.  great eyes, and catchlights in them.  and nice artistic job on the eyeliner and all.  very creative.', '2005-09-06 15:58:09.000000', NULL, 0),
