(1687495, 223463, 14603, '<td valign="top">What an absolutely superb pic.<br/>I have read a few of the comments and agree that the score does not do the picture justice.<br/>Great work..well done.</td>', 'What an absolutely superb pic.I have read a few of the comments and agree that the score does not do the picture justice.Great work..well done.', '2005-09-08 17:38:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(1687571, 223641, 24169, '<td valign="top"><b>Critique Club Comment</b> <br/> <br/>What a stunning image! The composition is so simple and yet so effective. I love the contrast that you brought out and the way the water sparkles against the darkness of the image. <br/> <br/>Perhaps the only complaint that I could make (and only if I was being extremely picky) is that IMO the writing on the left hand sail detracts from the rest of the image as when I was looking at the image in depth I found myself trying to figure out what was written there. <br/> <br/>But that is, as I said, only if I was being extremely picky. <br/> <br/>Well done on a great image!</td>', 'Critique Club Comment  What a stunning image! The composition is so simple and yet so effective. I love the contrast that you brought out and the way the water sparkles against the darkness of the image.  Perhaps the only complaint that I could make (and only if I was being extremely picky) is that IMO the writing on the left hand sail detracts from the rest of the image as when I was looking at the image in depth I found myself trying to figure out what was written there.  But that is, as I said, only if I was being extremely picky.  Well done on a great image!', '2005-09-08 17:53:32.000000', NULL, 0),
