(1776007, 223786, 37719, '<td valign="top">Great shot!  First, I am a fan of trains, so this scores right off the bat.  BUT...it is such a great shot - the perspective is totally unique which gives it an element not found often; the curve of the tracks is classic and also not found often in pics - usually one turn, but not an S curve; the smoke in the distance where the train has left the shot is perfect - leaves you wondering if the shot is ''new'' or ''old'' and it is an old steam engine pulling the load.  Maybe a little too much on the sharpening...not sure.  A b/w version might be worth a try as well - the shot can hold up I am sure.  Very well done!</td>', 'Great shot!  First, I am a fan of trains, so this scores right off the bat.  BUT...it is such a great shot - the perspective is totally unique which gives it an element not found often; the curve of the tracks is classic and also not found often in pics - usually one turn, but not an S curve; the smoke in the distance where the train has left the shot is perfect - leaves you wondering if the shot is ''new'' or ''old'' and it is an old steam engine pulling the load.  Maybe a little too much on the sharpening...not sure.  A b/w version might be worth a try as well - the shot can hold up I am sure.  Very well done!', '2005-10-11 08:59:11.000000', NULL, 0),
