(1819879, 223525, 38127, '<td valign="top">I''ve looked at this image about a thousand times.. (not quite that much but alot) and each time I pass it when browsing the site.. for whatever reason.. IT ALWAYS makes me pause... I think its become my All time favorite on the site so far... Its such a strong, powerful image.  One to be proud of on so many levels being your daughter and for getting such a perfect capture :) congrats.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-10-27 23:41:21.</i></td>', 'I''ve looked at this image about a thousand times.. (not quite that much but alot) and each time I pass it when browsing the site.. for whatever reason.. IT ALWAYS makes me pause... I think its become my All time favorite on the site so far... Its such a strong, powerful image.  One to be proud of on so many levels being your daughter and for getting such a perfect capture :) congrats.', '2005-10-28 00:32:07.000000', '2005-10-28 00:41:21.000000', 0),
(1819897, 223525, 19035, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Shecoya:</b></div><hr/><i> I''ve looked at this image about a thousand times.. (not quite that much but alot) and each time I pass it when browsing the site.. for whatever reason.. IT ALWAYS makes me pause... I think its become my All time favorite on the site so far... Its such a strong image and very powerful.  One to be proud of on so many levels being your daughter and for getting such a perfect capture :) congrats. </i></td></tr></table><i></i> <br/> <br/>Thank you so much for such a wonderful comment, I will share your thoughts with my little girl, thank you again.  Looking back at this shot I think it would have been great in the image grain challenge.</td>', 'Originally posted by Shecoya: I''ve looked at this image about a thousand times.. (not quite that much but alot) and each time I pass it when browsing the site.. for whatever reason.. IT ALWAYS makes me pause... I think its become my All time favorite on the site so far... Its such a strong image and very powerful.  One to be proud of on so many levels being your daughter and for getting such a perfect capture :) congrats.   Thank you so much for such a wonderful comment, I will share your thoughts with my little girl, thank you again.  Looking back at this shot I think it would have been great in the image grain challenge.', '2005-10-28 00:41:22.000000', NULL, 0),
