(2091358, 223553, 24628, '<td valign="top">Very nice Nerodia watersnake.  These are my favorite snakes down here in Florida.  I shoot a lot of Nerodia shots...  and they are often, unfortunately, mistaken for the venomous cottonmouths.  People kill these guys all the time because they are mistaken.  It''s a shame, really.<br/> <br/>Anyhow, great capture ~ beautiful photograph and subject!<br/> <br/>~ janson.</td>', 'Very nice Nerodia watersnake.  These are my favorite snakes down here in Florida.  I shoot a lot of Nerodia shots...  and they are often, unfortunately, mistaken for the venomous cottonmouths.  People kill these guys all the time because they are mistaken.  It''s a shame, really. Anyhow, great capture ~ beautiful photograph and subject! ~ janson.', '2006-01-27 06:27:37.000000', NULL, 0),
