(2429076, 223689, 47906, '<td valign="top">Very Nice colors on the water, great exposure with the clouds going from light to dark either leading the eye in or helping to exit the photo.(depending on the viewer) Not that I would change anything, but it would be neat to see what this photo would have looked like with a small crop of the upper dark clouds at the top of the picture to get rid of some of the grain shown by them. Overall I would have given it probably an 8.<br/> <br/>Great shot, thanks for sharing.<br/>Rich</td>', 'Very Nice colors on the water, great exposure with the clouds going from light to dark either leading the eye in or helping to exit the photo.(depending on the viewer) Not that I would change anything, but it would be neat to see what this photo would have looked like with a small crop of the upper dark clouds at the top of the picture to get rid of some of the grain shown by them. Overall I would have given it probably an 8. Great shot, thanks for sharing.Rich', '2006-05-18 07:47:56.000000', NULL, 0),
