(2801555, 223267, 51538, '<td valign="top">Keith,  This is a lovely image of St Michael''s Mount.  I remember it well, having surfed at Marazion many a time in the distant past before leaving for travel around the world.  As I remember, the seagulls on the Mount itself are well-practiced in bombing runs.  They have a rather dreadful chemical arsenal made from old pilchards.  Have a bit of that ordinance land in your hair (as I did one day while there) and it can be extremely embarassing!  ;-)</td>', 'Keith,  This is a lovely image of St Michael''s Mount.  I remember it well, having surfed at Marazion many a time in the distant past before leaving for travel around the world.  As I remember, the seagulls on the Mount itself are well-practiced in bombing runs.  They have a rather dreadful chemical arsenal made from old pilchards.  Have a bit of that ordinance land in your hair (as I did one day while there) and it can be extremely embarassing!  ;-)', '2006-09-05 19:15:41.000000', NULL, 0),
